{"id":"xpo-477ca3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7e35d7f8-1b79-4146-b0e3-865ce884a0dd","text":"## Implementation\n\nBuilt the command palette as a centered modal overlay with fuzzy search.\n\n### Features\n- **`Cmd+K` / `Ctrl+K`** opens the palette from anywhere\n- **`C`** global shortcut opens new issue modal (when no input focused)\n- **Fuzzy search** across issue titles, IDs, and labels\n- **Navigation** — jump to Issues, Board, Dashboard, Dependencies\n- **Quick actions** — 'Create new issue' with `C` shortcut hint\n- **Recent issues** — shows last 8 issues when no query typed\n- **Keyboard navigation** — arrow keys to move, Enter to select, Esc to close\n- **Auto-scroll** selected item into view\n- **Footer hints** showing keyboard shortcuts\n\n### Result groups\n- Actions (create new issue)\n- Navigation (Issues, Board, Dashboard, Dependencies with icons)\n- Issues / Recent Issues (status icon, title, short ID, label badges)\n\n### Integration\n- Sidebar search button now opens the palette instead of the inline filter\n- Portal-rendered at z-200 so it's above everything\n- State resets on open (query cleared, selection at top)\n\n### Files\n- `web/src/components/CommandPalette/CommandPalette.tsx` — new component\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — global keydown listener, state, render"},"created_at":"2026-05-19T07:56:28.132386Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
