{"id":"xpo-7d6c67","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7818338d-7872-49bb-880f-3b02dd330dd0","text":"## Implementation\n\nAdded copy-issue-ID functionality to both views.\n\n### Issue detail view\n- The issue ID in the breadcrumb is now clickable — click to copy, shows 'Copied!' feedback\n- **`.`** keyboard shortcut copies the current issue ID to clipboard\n\n### Issue list (backlog)\n- Each issue ID in the row is clickable — click to copy with 'Copied!' feedback\n- Click doesn't propagate to the row (won't open the issue)\n\n### Component\n- New `CopyableId` component in `web/src/components/ui/CopyableId.tsx`\n- Renders as a button with monospace styling, hover turns accent color, 1.5s 'Copied!' flash on click\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/ui/CopyableId.tsx` — new component\n- `web/src/components/ui/index.ts` — barrel export\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx` — use CopyableId + `.` shortcut\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — use CopyableId in rows"},"created_at":"2026-05-19T10:34:38.075585Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
