{"id":"xpo-55a6b3","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Make the unsaved state more prominent","description":"Introduce a bottom \"status bar\" in both the main menu on the left side and the main content window. The area in the nav menu shows version info, the one in the main content window displays \"dirty\" state more prominently so users are immediately aware when there are unsaved changes. When there are unsaved changes, the area that shows the version info turns into a \"Save\" button.","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-05-20T05:37:02.841662Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
