{"id":"xpo-55a6b3","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T05:38:01.445746Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-55a6b3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4a7941f0-0f0b-4daf-baed-6e4754b82330","text":"## Summary\n\nRedesigned the unsaved state to be more prominent:\n\n### Sidebar footer\n- **Clean state**: Shows version info (`Beats v0.3.0`) with logo\n- **Dirty state**: Transforms into a full-width Save button (accent colored)\n\n### Main content status bar\n- Appears below the main content panel when there are unsaved changes\n- Left: pulsing amber dot + clickable change count (opens pending changes view)\n- Right: Discard + Save actions as text links\n- Sits on the dark L0 app surface, visually distinct from content\n\n### Backend\n- Added `version` field to `/api/config` endpoint (from `internal/version` package)\n\n### Files changed\n- `internal/server/handlers.go`: added version import and field to config response\n- `web/src/api/client.ts`: updated config type\n- `web/src/App.tsx`: version state, passed to Layout\n- `web/src/components/Layout/Layout.tsx`: new footer + status bar design"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T06:15:53.770766Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-55a6b3","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T06:15:53.796098Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-55a6b3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-99d88977-64d6-4aac-85f2-f9251e38a50a","text":"## Update: Auto-save refactor\n\nReplaced the manual save/discard flow with server-side auto-persist:\n\n### Server\n- `handleDraft` now writes events directly to `issues.db` via `storage.AppendEvent()` instead of buffering in pending state\n\n### Frontend — removed\n- Pending state tracking (`fetchPending`, `setPending`, `PendingState`)\n- Save/discard handlers and `saveAll`/`discardAll` API calls\n- Save modal with commit message\n- Sidebar dirty-state footer (save button, discard, change count)\n- Main content status bar (unsaved changes indicator)\n- `PendingChanges` view and `showPending` state\n\n### Frontend — simplified\n- Layout now takes only: `currentView`, `onViewChange`, `onSearch`, `onNewIssue`, `version`\n- Sidebar footer shows version info permanently\n- No more pending/dirty UI — changes persist immediately on every action"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T06:24:50.553439Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-7710bb","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"sort_order":"ZxV"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T08:40:49.649209Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
