{"id":"xpo-7710bb","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ef4cd279-ab51-4501-8622-7488253ab906","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded clickable inline popovers for status, labels, and estimate directly on Backlog issue rows — matching the quick-edit pattern.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **Shared `Popover`/`PopoverHeader` components** extracted to `web/src/components/ui/Popover.tsx` — reused by both IssueDetail and Backlog\n- **Shared constants** extracted to `web/src/constants.ts` (`STATUS_OPTIONS`, `ESTIMATE_OPTIONS`, `PRIORITY_OPTIONS`, `BUILTIN_LABELS`)\n- **Status popover**: Click the status icon on any row to change status via popover with all status options\n- **Labels popover**: Click label badges to toggle labels; empty rows show a `+ label` hint on hover\n- **Estimate popover**: Click the triangle/number to set estimate; empty rows show a triangle hint on hover\n- All popovers call `addDraft` to persist changes and refresh the list\n- Click events on popovers use `stopPropagation` to avoid opening the issue detail"},"created_at":"2026-05-20T12:55:41.855665Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
