{"id":"xpo-5ea4a9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-27d042d2-97a5-4b90-87be-6a3ee6c93309","text":"## Changes\n\n- Added delete button to the issue detail sidebar with a confirmation dialog\n- On confirm, calls `addDraft(id, 'DELETE', {})` which routes through `client.DeleteIssue` (from the earlier handler refactor)\n- After deletion, navigates back to the issue list and refreshes\n- Confirmation state resets when navigating between issues\n\nNo backend changes needed — the `handleDraft` refactor already routes DELETE events through the proper `beats.Client.DeleteIssue` method."},"created_at":"2026-05-20T19:25:28.433908Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
