{"id":"xpo-6098b4","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0a7c8e10-a51d-4213-bc1d-c105ff46f785","text":"## Root cause\n\nGroup header rows had no `onDragOver`/`onDrop` handlers. When dragging an issue to the top of a group, the cursor would overshoot the first issue row into the group header, where the drop silently failed.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdded drag handlers to the group header. When dragging over a group header, the drop indicator is set to \"above the first issue\" in that group, and dropping on the header triggers the normal reorder logic."},"created_at":"2026-05-21T05:01:41.505751Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
