{"id":"xpo-f28d0f","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-21T06:21:21.115541Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-f28d0f","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9ecf8722-96c6-4a50-bd6d-9bc7004f807f","text":"## Changes\n\n### ALT+drag to nest issues\n- Hold ALT/Option while dragging an issue onto another issue to set it as a child\n- Target row highlights with accent ring + tint to indicate \"nest into this issue\"\n- On drop, sends `UPDATE` with `parent_id` set to the target issue\n\n### Guards\n- Cannot nest into self\n- Cannot nest into own descendants (prevents circular references)\n- Cannot nest into issues that are already children (single level of nesting)\n\n### Implementation\n- Added `dropNestTargetId` state with synchronous ref for the same stale-closure protection as other drag state\n- ALT check in `handleDragOver` takes priority — clears other indicators when active\n- Drop handled via shared `performDrop` function (works through both `handleDrop` and `handleDragEnd`)"},"created_at":"2026-05-21T06:23:40.424471Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-f28d0f","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-21T06:24:08.536937Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
