{"id":"xpo-74111b","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Context menu (right-click)","description":"We should have a right-click popover menu on issues in the issue index view that:\\\n- has menu options for common actions\\\n- has keyboard shortcuts to invoke those actions when the popover is open\\\n- shows the shortcuts in muted text on the far right side\\\n- shows an action icon on the far left side\\\n\\\nActions should include:\\\n- Status (S)\\\n- Priority (P)\\\n- Assignee (A)\\\n- Due date (Shift+D)\\\n- Labels (L)\\\n- Estimate (Shift+E)\\\n- Cycle (Shift+C)\\\n- Delete (CMD + Backspace)","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-05-22T05:33:49.085653Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
