{"id":"xpo-1a8bea","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2244248c-dee8-4495-916f-e1a69cbf15b6","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded Escape key handling to the `Popover` component. All popovers (status, estimate, labels) now close on Escape.\n\n### Changes\n\n- `web/src/components/ui/Popover.tsx`: Added a `keydown` listener for Escape alongside the existing `mousedown` outside-click listener. Since all popovers use this shared component, the fix applies everywhere."},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:14:21.386813Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-1a8bea","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:14:21.416423Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-5c20f1","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:14:53.940612Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-5c20f1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4154f6df-f30e-421b-9bb4-cfab44e3fa82","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `onMouseLeave` handler on the Backlog rows container to reset `focusedIndex` to `-1` when the mouse leaves the issue list area. Previously, the last hovered row stayed highlighted indefinitely.\n\n### Changes\n\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`: Added `onMouseLeave={() =\u003e setFocusedIndex(-1)}` to the rows scroll container div."},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:16:14.715224Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-5c20f1","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:16:14.743961Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-5c20f1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-74155583-fc4e-4942-a301-9afbe7cda103","text":"## Additional: keyboard vs mouse focus\n\nAdded a `keyboardNav` state flag to distinguish keyboard and mouse focus:\n\n- Arrow key navigation sets `keyboardNav = true`, mouse enter sets it back to `false`\n- When in keyboard mode: the focused row gets a faint accent border (`ring-1 ring-inset ring-accent-primary/40`), and CSS `hover:bg-*` is suppressed on non-focused rows so the mouse-hovered row doesn't also highlight\n- When in mouse mode: behavior is unchanged (hover highlight, no accent ring)\n- `onMouseLeave` only clears `focusedIndex` when not in keyboard mode, so arrow-key selection persists when the mouse exits the list"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:20:19.028569Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-94c3f1","type":"CREATE","payload":{"labels":["feature"],"title":"Ability to invoke labels, estimate popovers via keyboard shortcuts from index view"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:22:15.170127Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-94c3f1","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"labels":["feature","WebApp","UX"],"status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:22:21.510004Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-94c3f1","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:22:37.065408Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-94c3f1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-00a38921-b7bd-4316-b331-9b86ddaa19b5","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded keyboard shortcuts to open popovers from the index view when an issue row is focused:\n\n- `s` — open status popover\n- `l` — open labels popover\n- `e` — open estimate popover\n\n### Changes\n\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`: Added three key handlers in the existing keyboard nav `useEffect`. Each calls `setOpenPopover()` with the focused issue's ID and the corresponding type. The popovers already support Escape to close (from the Popover component fix)."},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:25:27.235029Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-94c3f1","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T07:25:27.265489Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-7dd45d","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T10:47:25.855267Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-7dd45d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9e890349-b098-4fb5-96cd-1ca99957f976","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented a dedicated Labels management view accessible from the sidebar navigation.\n\n### Backend\n- Added `DeleteLabel` and `UpdateLabel` functions to `internal/config/config.go` for YAML config manipulation\n- Added `PUT /api/config/labels` handler — renames label (name + color) and updates all issues referencing the old name\n- Added `DELETE /api/config/labels` handler — removes label from config and strips it from all issues\n\n### Frontend\n- Added `updateConfigLabel` and `deleteConfigLabel` API client functions\n- Created `Labels` view component (`web/src/components/Labels/Labels.tsx`) with:\n  - List of all labels with color dot, display name, and issue count\n  - Inline edit form (rename + recolor) with preset color palette\n  - Create new label form with name input and color picker\n  - Delete with inline confirmation prompt\n  - Edit/delete buttons appear on row hover\n  - Empty state with create prompt\n- Added Labels as a sidebar nav item (tag icon) between Board and Analytics\n- Wired `#/labels` hash route in App.tsx"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T11:32:31.323704Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-7dd45d","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T11:32:47.280561Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-19f91b","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","assignee":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T12:20:00.444045Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-19f91b","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-38844c82-f03c-4011-bd5e-fce7797f9eec","text":"## Changes\n\n### IssueDetail sidebar (`IssueDetail.tsx`)\n- Added **Assignee property row** between Parent and Author in the Properties card\n- Shows `GravatarIcon` + name when assigned, or `UserIcon` + \"No assignee\" when unset\n- Click opens a **searchable popover** listing all known people (extracted from `created_by` and `assignee` fields across all issues)\n- \"Remove assignee\" option appears when an assignee is set\n- Keyboard shortcut `a` opens the assignee popover\n- Changes sent via draft events (`saveDraft(\"UPDATE\", { assignee })`)\n\n### Backlog list (`Backlog.tsx`)\n- Added `AssigneeAvatar` helper component (gravatar with initial-letter fallback)\n- Assignee avatar displayed in issue rows between the estimate and date columns\n\n### No backend changes needed\nThe data model, events, projection, CLI, and API already fully supported assignees."},"created_at":"2026-05-22T12:15:07.47813Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-e1ee26","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"BACKLOG"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T14:29:08.712988Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-19f91b","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4cf7faf1-3c40-4473-a543-80afde477b36","text":"## Summary\n\n### New shared Avatar component (`web/src/components/ui/Avatar.tsx`)\n- Sizes: `xs` (14px), `sm` (16px), `md` (20px), `lg` (24px)\n- Gravatar with proper MD5 hashing, initial-letter fallback\n- Tooltip shows full identity (`Name \u003cemail\u003e`) for disambiguation\n- Exported from UI barrel, replaces three prior local implementations\n\n### IssueDetail sidebar (`IssueDetail.tsx`)\n- Added **Assignee property row** with searchable popover listing known people (deduped by email)\n- Keyboard shortcut `a` opens the assignee popover\n- Removed redundant Creator row (visible in activity timeline)\n- Labels card reworked from button to flat list with `+` add button\n- All property buttons now use shared `Button` component (`ghost`/`sm`)\n- Sidebar cards padding standardized to `px-4 py-3`\n- Removed local `GravatarIcon`, `UserIcon`, `Avatar`, and `md5` — all replaced by shared Avatar\n\n### Backlog list (`Backlog.tsx`)\n- Assignee avatar shown in issue rows between estimate and date columns\n- Removed local `AssigneeAvatar` — uses shared Avatar component"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T14:35:57.426241Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
