{"id":"xpo-2094f2","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a1eebba6-518c-4023-8502-454d2e72e0bc","text":"## Summary\n\n### Relations card reworked in IssueDetail sidebar (`IssueDetail.tsx`)\n\n- **Always visible** — no longer hidden when no dependencies exist\n- **Add relation** — \"+  Add relation\" button opens a two-step popover:\n  1. Pick relationship type (blocks, blocked by, depends on, dependency of, duplicates, duplicated by, relates to)\n  2. Search and select a target issue (filtered to exclude self and already-linked issues)\n- **Remove relation** — hover any existing relation to reveal an \"x\" button that removes it\n- **Enhanced display** — each relation now shows the target issue's StatusIcon + title (not just the raw ID)\n- Draft payload sends the full `dependencies` array via `saveDraft(\"UPDATE\", { dependencies: [...] })`, matching the backend's expected format"},"created_at":"2026-05-22T14:57:06.751234Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
