{"id":"xpo-42f277","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2ecbcf07-74f0-4fd9-8e73-f2a66cc92f32","text":"## Summary\n\nEnlarged the status icon button click target on issue rows in the backlog overview from 14×14px to 24×24px, mirroring the fix pattern from [[xpo-2165bd]].\n\n## Change\n\n`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — the per-row status icon button only had `hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity`, so its effective click target was the 14×14 `StatusIcon` SVG with no cursor or hover background to signal interactivity.\n\nUpdated to `w-6 h-6 -m-1 flex items-center justify-center rounded cursor-pointer hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors`:\n\n- `w-6 h-6` → 24×24px click target (~3× the previous area)\n- `-m-1` → negative margin collapses the visual footprint back to 16×16, so row layout and adjacent elements are unchanged\n- `cursor-pointer` → reads as clickable\n- `hover:bg-white/10` → visible button highlight regardless of whether the row itself is hovered\n\n## Verification\n\n- `make frontend` builds cleanly with no TS errors\n- Visual footprint unchanged → no layout shift on neighbouring `CopyableId`, title, or trailing controls"},"created_at":"2026-05-26T06:55:43.734486859Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
