{"id":"xpo-0ed889","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Our code, while functionally working, is currently condensed into a few very long files. This makes editing, reasoning and finding information difficult. In this effort, we will re-organized, refactor and split up code into smaller, self-contained modules, hooks, libraries, view components, etc. according to React app industry best practices.","labels":["improvement"],"title":"Refactor code"},"created_at":"2026-05-28T05:41:08.309151052Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-0ed889","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-05-28T05:41:08.642850484Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-0135c0","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Chrome polish","description":"Overall the application has a pleasant design, but in many places the design is incoherent or not followed 100%. Rounding and spacing not consistent, font sizes can be optimized, visual information hierarchy through text color, size, and weight to be followed more consistently, the \"layers\" and \"elevation\" concepts (backgrounds, borders, ...) be applied more consistently etc.","labels":["improvement"]},"created_at":"2026-05-28T05:43:01.321254228Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-0ed889","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","assignee":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-05-28T05:50:19.462412918Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-0ed889","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c2103ab3-b08b-484a-b0c9-f7fd2e8acf92","text":"## Summary\n\nRefactored the web frontend from a handful of monolithic files into smaller, self-contained modules following React best practices.\n\n### Shared Utilities Extracted\n- **`utils/format.ts`** — `shortName`, `formatRelativeTime`, `formatShortDate`, `formatTriage`, `stripMarkdown`, `linkifyIssueIds` (previously duplicated across 2–3 files each)\n- **`ui/SubProgress.tsx`** — shared circular progress ring (was duplicated in Backlog, Dashboard, and Board)\n\n### IssueDetail.tsx (1648 → 352 lines)\nSplit into 4 focused modules:\n- `PropertySidebar.tsx` — status, estimate, priority, parent, assignee, labels, relations, delete\n- `ActivityTimeline.tsx` — history fetching, event rendering, comment input\n- `SubIssuesTable.tsx` — child issue list with inline create\n- `icons.tsx` — PriorityIcon, EstimateIcon\n\n### Dashboard.tsx (1017 → 368 lines)\nSplit into 4 focused modules:\n- `Section.tsx` — collapsible Section layout, SectionIcon, PulseCard, icon path constants\n- `charts.tsx` — Sparkline, TrendChart SVG components\n- `ActivityFeed.tsx` — ActIcon, describeActivity, expandable comment feed\n- `DistributionSection.tsx` — filtered bar-chart distribution widget\n\n### Backlog.tsx (1636 → 603 lines)\nSplit into 2 focused modules:\n- `DndComponents.tsx` — GroupHeaderDnd, IssueRowDnd, DragOverlayCard, collision detection\n- `useBacklogRows.ts` — row-building hook (tree + ghost parent logic)\n\n### App.tsx (810 → 296 lines)\n- `NewIssueModal/NewIssueModal.tsx` — full new-issue modal with InlineDropdown\n\n### Before → After (largest files)\n| File | Before | After |\n|---|---|---|\n| IssueDetail.tsx | 1648 | 352 |\n| Backlog.tsx | 1636 | 603 |\n| Dashboard.tsx | 1017 | 368 |\n| App.tsx | 810 | 296 |\n\nNo file now exceeds ~634 lines. Build and all tests pass. Bundle size is essentially unchanged (1076 KB)."},"created_at":"2026-05-28T06:26:13.959297845Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.152 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
