{"id":"xpo-11e95c","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-9ea37ded-2bf2-4d0b-b352-24d5f3c6b162","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `CycleID` field across all layers of the stack:\n\n- **`internal/model/types.go`** — added `CycleID string` to `Issue`, `CycleID string` to `CreatePayload`, `CycleID *string` to `UpdatePayload`\n- **`internal/inputs/inputs.go`** — added `CycleID` to `AddInput` and `UpdateInput` with JSON schema descriptions, updated `ToCreatePayload()`, `ToUpdatePayload()`, and `UpdatePayloadEmpty()` \n- **`internal/beats/projection.go`** — populate `CycleID` from CREATE events, apply `CycleID` patches from UPDATE events\n- **`internal/mcpserver/tools.go`** — added `CycleID` to `issueSummary` and `showOut` response types, populated in `toSummary()` and `show()` handler\n- **`internal/server/responses.go`** — added `CycleID` to `IssueResponse`, populated in `issueToResponse()`\n\n### Backward compatibility\n\nExisting issues without a `CycleID` are unaffected — the field defaults to empty string, serialized as `omitempty` in JSON. No migration needed thanks to event-sourcing: old events simply don't set the field."},"created_at":"2026-06-01T07:08:28.655222475Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.158 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
