{"id":"xpo-64f3aa","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4d9dbcec-9991-4a14-9f02-33e6b251df6d","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded \"Cycle\" submenu to the issue context menu in `web/src/components/ui/ContextMenu.tsx`:\n\n- New `\"cycle\"` entry in `SubMenu` type and `MENU_ITEMS` array with a refresh/cycle icon\n- Keyboard shortcut: `C` opens the cycle submenu\n- Submenu shows: \"No cycle\" (when already assigned), then all non-completed cycles (current, upcoming, planned) with their status labels\n- Checkmark on the currently assigned cycle\n- Fetches cycles from `/api/cycles` on mount\n- Graceful fallback: shows \"Cycles not configured\" when cycles aren't enabled\n\nFollows the same flyout submenu pattern as Status, Priority, Assignee, Labels, and Estimate."},"created_at":"2026-06-01T11:58:19.767876917Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.158 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
