{"id":"xpo-c7b7c6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-6fb935b4-df76-4fdf-9872-e81117199e1b","text":"All sub-issues complete. The Cycles feature is fully shipped: config, data model, computed rollover, CLI commands, web UI (timeline view, detail view with burndown chart, cycle badges, context menu assignment), and final bugfixes for timeline highlighting and layout consistency."},"created_at":"2026-06-01T15:26:09.985830171Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.158 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
