{"id":"xpo-10d444","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8262d4e9-5caa-446a-9b7c-1e8c12186bad","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented the web UI review view with diff viewer, accessible as a \"Review\" tab on the issue detail page.\n\n### Backend (4 new API endpoints)\n\n**`internal/server/handlers.go`:**\n- `GET /api/issues/{id}/commits` → returns commit list (SHA + message)\n- `GET /api/issues/{id}/files` → returns per-file stats (status, path, +/-)\n- `GET /api/issues/{id}/diff` → returns raw unified diff as text/plain\n- `POST /api/issues/{id}/merge` → merges branch with strategy picker, returns merge SHA\n\nShared `resolveIssueBranch()` helper handles issue lookup, branch detection (remote + local fallback), and error responses.\n\n**`internal/server/router.go`** — four new route registrations.\n\n### Frontend\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/ReviewTab.tsx`** (new):\n- **Header card**: branch name, HEAD SHA badge, stats, merge button\n- **Merge panel**: strategy picker (squash/merge/ff), confirm button with loading/error states\n- **Commit list**: individual commits with SHA + message\n- **File list**: collapsible per-file view with status icons (A=green, D=red, M=muted), +/- stats\n- **Inline diff viewer**: per-file expandable unified diff with colored +/- lines and hunk headers\n- `parseDiffByFile()` splits the unified diff into per-file chunks for collapsible display\n- Expand all / collapse all controls\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`** — added tab bar switching between \"Activity\" and \"Review\" tabs. Review tab only visible when branch_stats has commits.\n\n**`web/src/api/client.ts`** — added `fetchIssueCommits`, `fetchIssueFiles`, `fetchIssueDiff`, `mergeIssue` API functions and types.\n\n### Also changed\n\n- `internal/beats/review.go` — exported `FillLocalBranchStats` (was `fillLocalBranchStats`), added `GetDiffText()` helper\n- `internal/beats/merge.go` — updated to use exported `FillLocalBranchStats`"},"created_at":"2026-06-09T09:14:48.547228729Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.169 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
