{"id":"xpo-8c6306","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"## Summary\n\nAdd a `beats_merge` MCP tool that merges an issue's branch into the default branch, records a `MERGE` event, and transitions the issue to `DONE`. This enables AI agents to complete the full issue lifecycle without shelling out to the CLI.\n\n## Implementation\n\nReuse the existing `client.MergeIssue()` method from `internal/beats/merge.go`. The MCP tool should:\n\n1. Accept issue ID and optional strategy (`squash`, `merge`, `ff`)\n2. Pre-flight check: working tree must be clean\n3. Call `client.MergeIssue()` with the given options\n4. Return merge SHA and messages\n\n## MCP Tool Definition\n\n```go\nmcp.AddTool(s, \u0026mcp.Tool{\n    Name:        \"beats_merge\",\n    Description: \"Merge an issue's branch into the default branch, record a MERGE event, and close the issue.\",\n}, t.merge)\n```\n\n### Input\n\n- `id` (required) — Issue ID\n- `strategy` (optional, default `squash`) — `squash`, `merge`, or `ff`\n- `delete_branch` (optional, default `false`) — Delete branch after merge\n\n### Output\n\n- `id` — Issue ID\n- `merge_sha` — SHA of the merge commit\n- `messages` — Status messages\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `beats_merge` MCP tool registered in `internal/mcpserver/tools.go`\n- [ ] Accepts issue ID, strategy, delete_branch parameters\n- [ ] Pre-flight: rejects if working tree is dirty\n- [ ] Calls `client.MergeIssue()` and returns result\n- [ ] Works with local and remote branches","estimate":2,"labels":["feature"],"parent_id":"xpo-4f6d6d","status":"PLANNED","title":"MCP tool: beats_merge for merging issue branches"},"created_at":"2026-06-09T14:30:22.937450513Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.169 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-c58f02","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-35504d46-4e45-4989-9a62-9483176acf9e","text":"## Summary\n\nRemoved the leftover tab bar that showed a single \"Activity\" tab on the issue detail view. The Review tab was superseded by the dedicated MergeView that opens from the \"Merge Branch\" button.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **`web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`** — removed tab bar markup, `activeTab` state, and `ReviewTab` import. `ActivityTimeline` now renders directly without a tab wrapper.\n- **`web/src/components/IssueDetail/ReviewTab.tsx`** — deleted. No longer needed since the MergeView handles all review/diff functionality."},"created_at":"2026-06-09T14:30:48.505853675Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.169 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
