{"id":"xpo-8c6306","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-f7c906c1-45d2-4dae-a4c3-980723b14f9c","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `beats_merge` MCP tool for merging issue branches.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`internal/mcpserver/tools.go`:**\n- Added `mergeIn` struct with `id` (required), `strategy` (squash/merge/ff, default squash), `commit_message` (optional), `delete_branch` (optional)\n- Added `mergeOut` struct returning `id`, `merge_sha`, `messages`\n- Registered `beats_merge` tool with description\n- Handler checks working tree cleanliness, maps strategy, calls `client.MergeIssue()` with all options\n\nAlso fixed `beats_start` tool description to reflect the `-` branch separator (was still showing `/`)."},"created_at":"2026-06-09T16:00:30.39636327Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.169 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
