{"id":"xpo-136aec","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-865351c5-3e01-4a47-b8de-e1558b32840a","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded a toggleable story points / issue count display to status section headers in the Backlog view.\n\n**Files changed:**\n\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/useBacklogRows.ts` — added `storyPoints` field to the group `RowItem` type, computed as the sum of `estimate` across issues in each status group.\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — added `showStoryPoints` toggle state. The count badge is now clickable: **#** prefix shows issue count (default), **▲** prefix shows total story points. Icon and number sit in fixed-size containers to prevent layout shift on toggle.\n\nThe toggle is global — clicking any section header's badge switches all headers at once."},"created_at":"2026-06-11T06:19:49.266619353Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.170 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
