{"id":"xpo-6cb6e0","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-46e828ac-ea4b-423b-9ae4-d085ebf032bf","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded full-page empty state onboarding for Dashboard, Backlog, and Board views when a project has zero issues.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`web/src/components/ui/EmptyState.tsx`** — new shared component with configurable icon (SVG), title, description, CTA button, and a keyboard shortcut hint (`C` to create).\n\n**`web/src/components/Dashboard/Dashboard.tsx`** — added `onNewIssue` prop; early return with \"Welcome to Beats\" empty state when `issues.length === 0`.\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`** — added `onNewIssue` prop; early return with \"No issues yet\" empty state.\n\n**`web/src/components/Board/Board.tsx`** — added `onNewIssue` prop; early return with \"Your board is empty\" empty state showing four dashed columns.\n\n**`web/src/App.tsx`** — passes `onNewIssue={() =\u003e setShowNewIssue(true)}` to all three views.\n\n**`web/src/components/ui/index.ts`** — exported `EmptyState`.\n\nEach illustration is a lightweight inline SVG using the design system's CSS vars, matching the existing error-state art style."},"created_at":"2026-06-12T09:37:47.953560373Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
