{"id":"xpo-d429a6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c714258d-d73f-4094-8170-b757f2e9bd49","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented structured filtering for the Backlog view with a nested filter menu and status bar chips.\n\n### New files\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/filters.ts`** — `BacklogFilters` type, `EMPTY_FILTERS` constant, `hasActiveFilters()` helper. Separated from components for clean Vite HMR.\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/FilterMenu.tsx`** — nested popover with 5 filter dimensions (Status, Assignee, Priority, Labels, Epic). Each dimension row opens a sub-menu with searchable checkboxes and issue counts. Counts reflect the currently filtered issue set so they stay consistent across dimensions. Uses `createPortal` with separate refs for main menu and sub-menu to handle outside-click detection correctly.\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/FilterChips.tsx`** — compact removable chips rendered in the bottom status bar. Shows dimension name + selected values (or count if \u003e2). Per-filter and global clear buttons.\n\n### Modified\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`** — funnel icon button with active-filter dot indicator, `F` keyboard shortcut, extended `filteredIssues` chain with AND/OR logic across all dimensions.\n\n**`web/src/components/Layout/Layout.tsx`** — new `statusBarLeft` prop renders filter chips in the bottom status bar alongside the existing connection indicator.\n\n**`web/src/App.tsx`** — manages `backlogFilters` state with `localStorage` persistence per tab, passes filter chips to Layout and filters to Backlog.\n\n### Filter logic\n\n- AND across dimensions (label:bug AND assignee:alice)\n- OR within dimensions (label:bug OR label:feature)\n- Composes with existing text search and status tabs"},"created_at":"2026-06-13T06:31:54.413269426Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
