{"id":"xpo-29bf29","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-66484e74-c0f9-471b-9c2c-b54b3f768d25","text":"## Summary\n\nCleaned up the new issue dialog styling: status options now show `StatusIcon` icons, and label badges render without borders throughout the dialog.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`web/src/components/ui/InlineDropdown.tsx`** — added `icon` field to `DropdownOption` for custom icons in trigger and dropdown rows.\n\n**`web/src/components/ui/Badge.tsx`** — added `borderless` prop to `LabelBadge` to suppress the badge border.\n\n**`web/src/components/ui/LabelPicker.tsx`** — added `borderlessBadges` prop, forwarded to all `LabelBadge` instances in the picker rows.\n\n**`web/src/components/NewIssueModal/NewIssueModal.tsx`** — status options use `StatusIcon`, both label pickers use `borderlessBadges`, and label badges in the trigger buttons use `borderless`."},"created_at":"2026-06-13T06:52:35.569631835Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
