{"id":"xpo-6b61d3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8b6882bd-c0df-4ed2-bcc8-a5955ed8f3e8","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed story point counts in backlog group headers.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/useBacklogRows.ts`** — two fixes to the `storyPoints` calculation:\n\n1. Unestimated issues now count as 1 point (`i.estimate || 1` instead of `i.estimate || 0`)\n2. Epics with children in the same group are excluded from the sum to prevent double-counting (epic's own points + children's points)"},"created_at":"2026-06-13T08:21:43.485155461Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
