{"id":"xpo-520aeb","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"It would be nice to have a graphical velocity chart, so we can see how backlog grows over time and burns down over time. Also a card that shows \"daily velocity\" i.e. how many story points completed each day","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b2G","title":"Velocity chart in Overview"},"created_at":"2026-06-13T08:24:39.74975061Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
