{"id":"xpo-025679","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-b88a8995-4c2f-4bff-ac45-a8a05d360e8a","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed epics showing full story point count instead of remaining points.\n\n### Changes\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/useBacklogRows.ts`** — added `childPointsDone` and `childPointsTotal` to issue row items, computed from children's estimates (unestimated = 1 point).\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`** — the estimate column now shows `childPointsTotal - childPointsDone` for issues with children (epics), and `issue.estimate` for leaf issues. An epic with 55 total points and 32 done now shows 23 remaining."},"created_at":"2026-06-13T08:25:54.711163712Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
