{"id":"xpo-520aeb","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-d900078d-b057-4cf4-ae04-eb0130211ab4","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented velocity charts and flow statistics for the Overview dashboard.\n\n### Backend — `internal/server/metrics.go`\n\n- Added 14-day daily velocity buckets (`daily_buckets`) to the velocity response\n- Added velocity delta (last 7d vs prior 7d points)\n- Added flow metrics: cycle time, lead time (min/median/p75/p90/max in hours), and staleness distribution\n- Fixed negative cycle times by guarding `doneAt \u003e doingAt`\n\n### Frontend — Charts (`web/src/components/Dashboard/charts.tsx`)\n\n- `DailyVelocityChart` — Recharts step area chart, full-width, 14 daily ticks\n- `CumulativeChart` — Recharts cumulative area chart for created vs completed\n- `TrendChart` — Recharts bar chart (kept for future use)\n- `DistributionBar` — kept for future use\n\n### Frontend — Dashboard (`web/src/components/Dashboard/`)\n\nPulse section restructured:\n- **Top row (50/50)**: Created vs Completed cumulative chart | Daily Velocity step chart\n- **Bottom row (4 cards)**: Velocity (big number + sparkline, vertically centered) | Cycle Time (bordered table: Min/Median/P90/Max) | Lead Time (same table format) | Staleness (bar distribution)\n- All legends pinned to card bottom for consistent visual hierarchy\n- Backend reports hours, frontend auto-formats to best unit (m/h/d/w/mo) via `formatDuration`\n\nOther changes:\n- Moved Composition section between Pulse and Activity\n- Added \"By Status\" distribution card showing all 5 statuses\n- Labels use color dot + name instead of badge style\n- Status card hides progress bars\n- Bars scaled relative to total, not max\n- Default filter changed to \"All\"\n- Auto-hide scrollbars on composition cards\n- Removed Trends section and status count cards from view (code kept)\n- Added `recharts` dependency"},"created_at":"2026-06-13T10:05:21.610940555Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-520aeb","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-13T10:05:28.877759092Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.175 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-38a287","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Overview: Composition cards should have uniform height","description":"In the **Overview** view, the \"Composition\" cards have inconsistent heights depending on how many items they contain.\n\n## Expected behavior\n\n- All Composition cards should have a **fixed height** sized to fit **5 items**.\n- When a card has **more than 5 items**, its content should scroll (current behavior — keep as-is).\n- When a card has **fewer than 5 items**, the card should maintain the same fixed height with empty space below the items.\n\n## Why\n\nUniform card heights create a cleaner, more visually consistent layout and prevent cards from jumping around or causing uneven rows.","status":"PLANNED","labels":["bug"]},"created_at":"2026-06-14T07:10:55.917636617Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.176 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-38a287","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-14T07:15:01.183146888Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.176 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-38a287","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-bb1e5e14-73d7-4081-be7b-ba292e208bf9","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed Composition cards in the Overview to have uniform height regardless of item count.\n\n### Change — `web/src/components/Dashboard/DistributionSection.tsx`\n\n- Content list: changed `max-h-40` → `h-40` so the list area is always 160px tall. Cards with fewer than 5 items now show empty space; cards with more still scroll as before.\n- Empty state: changed `flex-1` → `h-40` so zero-item cards match the same height.\n- Outer card: removed `min-h-40` since both branches now enforce height directly."},"created_at":"2026-06-14T07:33:47.567250071Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.176 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
