{"id":"xpo-b937af","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-434e5f30-8179-4b7d-a9b7-4551abd1a1bc","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed title flicker when editing, using the same optimistic state pattern as the description fix (`xpo-b441fa`).\n\n**Changes in `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`:**\n- Added `optimisticTitle` state, set in `handleSaveTitle` before calling `saveDraft`\n- Display uses `optimisticTitle ?? issue.title` in both the h1 and the breadcrumb\n- Optimistic value clears once `issue.title` matches after refresh\n- Reset on issue navigation"},"created_at":"2026-06-15T07:23:52.594887711Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.177 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-70174a","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1c692b11-65b7-4b35-890f-b272dc9d8317","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed link clicks in the description entering edit mode.\n\n**Change in `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`:**\n- Description wrapper's `onClick` now checks `(e.target as HTMLElement).closest('a')` — if the click originated from an anchor element, the handler returns early and the link navigates normally without entering edit mode."},"created_at":"2026-06-15T07:23:52.702701523Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.177 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
