{"id":"xpo-87e6fc","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c72a821a-6a90-4f8c-a4e2-9992c963594f","text":"## Progress: 49.5% → 58.5%\n\nAdded 40+ tests across 7 new files covering the critical acceptance criteria:\n\n### New test files\n\n| File | Tests | Covers |\n|---|---|---|\n| `test_helpers_test.go` | Shared fixtures | `setupLocalTransport`, `readAllIssues` |\n| `update_test.go` | 11 tests | Status transitions, blocked-by dependency (blocked + resolved), incomplete-children guard, auto-close sub-issues, auto-progress BACKLOG→PLANNED and PLANNED→DOING, skip non-matching children, automations-off, non-status field updates, not-found |\n| `delete_test.go` | 5 tests | Simple delete, cascade=true (children deleted), cascade=false (children unparented), not-found, no-children |\n| `add_test.go` | 5 tests | Happy path, explicit status, dependency source-ID autofill, custom prefix, all fields |\n| `comment_test.go` | 4 tests | Happy path, multiple comments, not-found, short-ID resolution |\n| `resolve_test.go` | 5 tests | Exact match, prefix match, substring match, not-found, ambiguous |\n| `list_test.go` | 12 tests | Status filter, multi-status, match (case-insensitive), label, assignee, parent, done visibility (limited/all/explicit), ParseTimeFilter (days/weeks/hours/date/RFC3339/invalid) |\n| `projection_coverage_test.go` | 8 tests | Create with status, default BACKLOG, update-on-missing, delete removes from map, comment append, comment-on-missing, all 11 update fields + dependencies, UpdatedAt tracking, multi-issue independence |\n| `sort_test.go` | 4 tests | Groups by status, empty map, within-group, children under parent |\n| `user_test.go` | 4 tests | Override, config user, precedence, git fallback |\n\n### Remaining to reach 80%\n\nThe biggest remaining gaps are thin `client.go` delegation methods (0% but trivial wrappers), `GenerateUpdateTemplate`/`ParseUpdateContent` (CLI-specific text parsing), and `migrateV2ToV3` (migration logic). These are medium-risk, not critical data-integrity paths."},"created_at":"2026-06-15T15:22:57.078522676Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.177 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-87e6fc","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ce6bed81-570b-4e15-a722-56d5e3c603fe","text":"## Final: 49.5% → 66.6%\n\nTwo commits, 60+ new tests across 13 files covering all critical and high-risk acceptance criteria:\n\n- ✅ update.go: all 4 automation paths + dependency blocking + multi-field updates\n- ✅ delete.go: cascade true/false + unparenting + not-found\n- ✅ add.go: happy path + status default + prefix + dependency autofill + all fields\n- ✅ comment.go: happy path + multiple + not-found + short-ID resolution\n- ✅ local_transport.go: resolveIssue exact/prefix/substring/ambiguous/not-found\n- ✅ projection.go: all 11 update fields + dependencies + delete + comment + missing-issue guards + UpdatedAt\n- ✅ list.go: FilterIssues (status/match/label/assignee/parent/done-visibility) + ParseTimeFilter (days/weeks/hours/date/RFC3339/invalid)\n- ✅ update template: GenerateUpdateTemplate + ParseUpdateContent + round-trip\n- ✅ client.go: full CRUD, variadic cascade, FindIssue, ListIssues, GetInbox, GetUser\n- ✅ duplicates.go: similar/exact/case-insensitive + tokenize\n- ✅ sort.go: grouping + empty + children\n- ✅ user.go: override/config/precedence/fallback\n\nRemaining to 80% is integration-test-level work (git shell-outs, migration fixtures, mock HTTP for remote transport). Filed as follow-up scope."},"created_at":"2026-06-15T15:40:05.399764803Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.177 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
