{"id":"xpo-918bd8","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"- Press CMD/CTRL + K to open the command palette\n- Enter a search term to filter the list to issues\n- Press the down arrow twice for selecting an issue\n\nEvery down arrow key press jumps the selection down two issues, skipping one isue.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"b23","title":"Arrow keys in CMD palette skip lines"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T07:08:31.433966075Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
