{"id":"xpo-1e720d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-32eb06bf-0be1-4487-a917-5ac8d89658d9","text":"## Summary\n\n**Root cause**: `Backlog.tsx` line 693 — when filter menu is open, the keyboard handler returns early for all keys, including Escape. No way to close the menu without a mouse.\n\n**Fix**: Added Escape check before the early return. When filter menu is open and Escape is pressed, it closes the menu and restores backlog keyboard nav. All other keys remain blocked while the menu is open."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:44:01.201497867Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
