{"id":"xpo-fc2d80","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-551bbd77-67ac-4e6b-8dc0-188614257f2f","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `/` keyboard shortcut to focus the backlog search input. Added `onSearchFocus` prop to `Backlog` component, wired through `App.tsx`. The existing Escape handler in the search input already clears the query and returns focus to the list. Guarded by `isEditableTarget()` so `/` doesn't fire when already in an input."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:49:22.368587065Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
