{"id":"xpo-9c933d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e74ac897-035d-4338-9117-4b7baf177efb","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded number key (1-5) selection in context menu submenus for status and priority, matching the issue detail shortcuts.\n\n- **Status submenu**: 1=Backlog, 2=Planned, 3=In Progress, 4=Blocked, 5=Done (number hints were already shown; now they work)\n- **Priority submenu**: 1=No priority, 2=Urgent, 3=High, 4=Medium, 5=Low (added number hints + keyboard handler)\n\nNumber keys are handled when a submenu is open, before the early return that blocks main menu shortcuts."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T08:54:34.194670523Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
