{"id":"xpo-c57e08","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-fe5cfb32-fe57-4058-863a-fd20fa75626d","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `?` keyboard shortcut that opens a help overlay listing all keyboard shortcuts, grouped into Global, Backlog, Issue Detail, and Pickers \u0026 Menus. Closes on `?` or `Esc`. Handles both `e.key === '?'` and `Shift + /` for keyboard layout compatibility. Handler fires before `isEditableTarget` check to work regardless of focus state."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T09:50:22.577711213Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
