{"id":"xpo-d86e61","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING","assignee":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:04:30.662181263Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-d86e61","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-13f22866-0fcf-47ed-a86c-8c3fe0d3fc1a","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded full keyboard navigation to the Board view:\n\n- **J/↓ and K/↑**: navigate cards within a column\n- **←/→**: move between columns (skips empty columns)\n- **Enter**: open focused card's detail view\n- **S/L/E**: quick-edit status, labels, estimate via shared picker popovers\n- **2-5**: instant status change — move focused card to Planned/Doing/Blocked/Done\n- **.**: copy focused issue ID\n- Visual focus: accent-colored border + ring on the active card, auto-scrolls into view\n- Column headers show `kbd` shortcut hints (2/3/4/5) and `#` icon with count\n\nUses the shared `StatusPicker`, `EstimatePicker`, and `LabelPicker` components for consistent keyboard behavior. Empty columns are skipped during horizontal navigation.\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/Board/Board.tsx` — keyboard handler, focus state, popover rendering\n- `web/src/components/Board/BoardColumn.tsx` — `focusedId` prop, shortcut kbd, count icon\n- `web/src/components/Board/BoardCard.tsx` — `isFocused` prop, focus ring, `data-board-card` attribute"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:36:02.414344995Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-d86e61","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:36:06.801273748Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-309e0c","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"## Summary\\n\\nThree areas of polish for the board view to make it production-ready.\\n\\n## 1. Collapsible columns\\n\\n- Each column header should have a collapse/expand toggle\\n- Collapsed columns show as a thin vertical strip with the status icon, label (rotated), and issue count\\n- Persist collapsed state in localStorage\\n- Keyboard: allow collapsing/expanding the focused column\\n\\n## 2. Backlog column\\n\\n- Add a Backlog column on the far left, **collapsed by default**\\n- Visually separated from the active columns with a dashed/dotted border style (not solid)\\n- Pressing `1` on a focused card moves it to Backlog — the card remains visible in the collapsed backlog strip instead of disappearing\\n- Expanding the Backlog column shows the full card list like any other column\\n- Shortcut `1` hint in the column header, matching 2-5 on the other columns\\n\\n## 3. Card layout — canonical metadata regions\\n\\nStandardize card layout using four metadata corners:\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\\n│ NW: issue ID, parent       NE: assignee avatar, priority │\\n│                                 │\\n│ Title (main content, 2 lines)   │\\n│                                 │\\n│ SW: labels                 SE: estimate, date │\\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n- **NW**: Issue ID (mono, muted) + parent breadcrumb if present\\n- **NE**: Assignee avatar + priority icon (using `PriorityIcon`)\\n- **Title**: Full width, `text-sm font-medium`, 2-line clamp\\n- **SW**: Label badges\\n- **SE**: Estimate points + created date\\n- Replace the `!!!`/`!!`/`!` priority markers with `PriorityIcon` (same fix we did for the dashboard composition card)\\n- Pending indicator dot stays in NE area\\n\\nThis layout should be consistent with how we present issues in Needs Attention cards and other list views.","estimate":5,"labels":["improvement"],"status":"PLANNED","title":"Board view polish — collapsible columns, backlog column, card layout"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:41:17.610048753Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-309e0c","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Summary\n\nThree areas of polish for the board view to make it production-ready.\n\n## 1. Collapsible columns\n\n- Each column header should have a collapse/expand toggle\n- Collapsed columns show as a thin vertical strip with the status icon, label (rotated), and issue count\n- Persist collapsed state in localStorage\n- Keyboard: allow collapsing/expanding the focused column\n\n## 2. Backlog column\n\n- Add a Backlog column on the far left, **collapsed by default**\n- Visually separated from the active columns with a dashed/dotted border style (not solid)\n- Pressing `1` on a focused card moves it to Backlog — the card remains visible in the collapsed backlog strip instead of disappearing\n- Expanding the Backlog column shows the full card list like any other column\n- Shortcut `1` hint in the column header, matching 2-5 on the other columns\n\n## 3. Card layout — canonical metadata regions\n\nStandardize card layout using four metadata corners:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│ NW: issue ID, parent       NE: assignee avatar, priority │\n│                                 │\n│ Title (main content, 2 lines)   │\n│                                 │\n│ SW: labels                 SE: estimate, date │\n└─────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n- **NW**: Issue ID (mono, muted) + parent breadcrumb if present\n- **NE**: Assignee avatar + priority icon (using `PriorityIcon`)\n- **Title**: Full width, `text-sm font-medium`, 2-line clamp\n- **SW**: Label badges\n- **SE**: Estimate points + created date\n- Replace the `!!!`/`!!`/`!` priority markers with `PriorityIcon`\n- Pending indicator dot stays in NE area\n\nThis layout should be consistent with how we present issues in Needs Attention cards and other list views."},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:42:30.534155792Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-309e0c","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"assignee":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T10:44:25.445066419Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-3b16a4","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"labels":["feature","WebUI"]},"created_at":"2026-06-16T12:00:17.392245842Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-309e0c","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-39785408-68bc-4241-a10b-d5b372430ba4","text":"## Summary\n\n### Collapsible columns\n- Each column header has a collapse toggle (far right)\n- Collapsed columns render as a thin 40px vertical strip with rotated label, status icon, and count\n- Collapsed state persisted in localStorage\n- Keyboard nav skips collapsed columns\n\n### Backlog column\n- Added as first column, collapsed by default, dashed border styling\n- `1` key moves focused card to Backlog (visible in collapsed strip)\n- Expanding shows full card list like other columns\n\n### Card layout — canonical NW/NE/SW/SE metadata regions\n- **NW**: Issue ID (mono, xs) + parent breadcrumb\n- **NE**: Pending dot + estimate (triangle icon + number) + priority icon (`PriorityIcon`) + assignee avatar\n- **Center**: Title (font-medium, 2-line clamp)\n- **SW**: Labels + sub-issue progress\n- **SE**: Cycle (icon + ID, if assigned) + date\n\n### Context menu\n- Same `ContextMenu` component from backlog now available on board cards via right-click\n- Fixed stale issue snapshot bug in both board and backlog — context menu now resolves live issue by ID\n\n### Optimistic updates\n- `patchIssue` callback from App.tsx instantly patches local issue state\n- Context menu and board quick-updates (S/L/E, number keys) feel instant\n- Server refresh confirms in background\n\n### Typography and spacing cleanup\n- Replaced all `text-[10px]` (25 instances) and `text-[11px]` (4 instances) with `text-xs` across 9 files\n- Replaced `pl-[22px]`/`ml-[22px]` with `pl-6`/`ml-6` (snapped to 4px grid)\n- UI now uses a clean type hierarchy: `text-xs` (12px) / `text-sm` (14px) / `text-base` (16px)"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T12:37:19.577530908Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-309e0c","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T12:37:23.79564957Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
