{"id":"xpo-0f271b","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-516bb641-e268-4825-bfca-8811f6a876c3","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `G` chord for global view switching. Press `G` then a second key within 1 second:\n\n- `G` `O` — Overview\n- `G` `B` — Backlog\n- `G` `R` — Board\n- `G` `I` — Inbox\n- `G` `D` — Dependencies\n- `G` `L` — Labels\n- `G` `C` — Cycles\n\nUses a ref-based pending state with 1-second timeout. The chord handler fires before other single-key shortcuts so `G` `C` doesn't conflict with standalone `C` (create issue). All shortcuts documented in the `?` help overlay under Global.\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — `gPendingRef`, `GO_TARGETS` map, chord handler in global keydown listener\n- `web/src/components/KeyboardHelp/KeyboardHelp.tsx` — added G chord entries to Global section"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:05:58.165045537Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
