{"id":"xpo-3b16a4","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8802fe8d-e53a-48b8-b58c-4567f7d20fa3","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded full keyboard navigation to the Notifications (formerly Inbox) view:\n\n- **J/↓** and **K/↑**: navigate between issue groups\n- **→**: expand older events on focused card\n- **←**: collapse older events on focused card\n- **Enter**: open the focused issue\n- **R**: mark all as read\n- Visual focus: accent border + ring on active card, auto-scrolls into view\n- Focus resets when switching New/Read tabs\n\nAlso as part of this work:\n- Renamed \"Inbox\" to \"Notifications\" across sidebar, command palette, toast, keyboard help\n- Swapped tray icon to bell icon in sidebar and command palette\n- Updated `G` chord: `G I` = Issues, `G B` = Board, `G N` = Notifications\n- Added spacing between columns in keyboard help dialog\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/Inbox/Inbox.tsx` — keyboard handler, focus state, expand/collapse, mark-read shortcut\n- `web/src/components/Layout/Layout.tsx` — label + icon rename\n- `web/src/components/CommandPalette/CommandPalette.tsx` — label + icon rename\n- `web/src/components/KeyboardHelp/KeyboardHelp.tsx` — Notifications section, updated G chord labels, column spacing\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — updated G chord targets, toast text"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:34:32.913075684Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
