{"id":"xpo-6581f4","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ab931f76-c713-408d-bda3-58dd0d235c9b","text":"## Summary\n\nRedesigned the toast notification system with variant support and specific messages.\n\n### Toast component (`Toast.tsx`)\n- Three variants: **success** (green checkmark, 2.5s auto-dismiss), **info** (no icon, auto-dismiss), **error** (red styling, warning icon, persistent until clicked)\n- Error toasts show X dismiss indicator and require click to close\n- Backward-compatible API: `showToast(msg)` defaults to success, `showToast(msg, { variant: \"error\" })` for errors\n\n### Specific messages across all call sites\n- `IssueDetail.tsx`: \"Status changed to DOING\", \"Assigned to Alice\", \"Priority updated\", \"Estimate set to 5\", \"Title updated\", \"Description updated\", \"Labels updated\", \"Comment added\"\n- `Backlog.tsx`: \"Status changed to PLANNED\", \"Estimate set to 3\", `Added label \"bug\"` / `Removed label \"bug\"`\n- `App.tsx`: error toast on failed mark-all-read with actual error message\n\n### Error visibility\n- API errors in IssueDetail now surface via `{ variant: \"error\" }` — red, persistent, shows the server error message\n- Inbox mark-all-read errors no longer silently swallowed\n\n### Also in this commit\n- SubIssuesTable: replaced `!!!`/`!!`/`!` priority markers with `PriorityIcon`\n- Fixed escaped `\\n` in descriptions across 9 keyboard nav issues"},"created_at":"2026-06-16T13:59:15.966550369Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.178 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
