{"id":"xpo-0d978a","type":"CREATE","payload":{"assignee":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","description":"## Summary\n\nRebrand from `beats` to **Exponential** (`xpo` binary). Enabling exponentially faster development with AI agents.\n\n## Key Decisions\n\n| Item | Old | New |\n|------|-----|-----|\n| Go module | `github.com/palarix/beats` | `github.com/palarix/exponential` |\n| Binary | `beats` | `xpo` |\n| Data dir | `.beats/` | `.xpo/` |\n| User config | `~/.config/beats/` | `~/.config/xpo/` |\n| Env prefix | `BEATS_*` | `XPO_*` |\n| MCP tools | `beats_list`, etc. | `xpo_list`, etc. |\n| MCP server | `\"beats\"` | `\"xpo\"` |\n| Frontend brand | \"Beats\" | \"Exponential\" |\n| Commit prefix | `beats:` | `xpo:` |\n| Default ID prefix | `beats-` | `xpo-` (fallback in `sanitizePrefix`) |\n\nClean break — no backward compatibility, no migration, no deprecated env var fallbacks.\n\n## Scope\n\nSee `rename.md` for the full implementation plan covering:\n\n- Go module + imports (~60 files)\n- Directory renames (`cmd/beats` → `cmd/xpo`, `internal/beats` → `internal/xpo`, skill dirs)\n- String literals (config paths, commit messages, env vars, MCP tool names)\n- Frontend (branding, localStorage keys, CSS classes)\n- Build/CI (Makefile, Dockerfile, GitHub Actions)\n- Documentation (README, CHANGELOG, CLAUDE.md, design docs)\n- Tests (hardcoded IDs, paths, tool names)\n\n## Estimated touch points\n\n- ~60 Go source files with import/string changes\n- ~10 frontend files\n- ~170+ doc references\n- CI workflow, Makefile, Dockerfile, .mcp.json, CLAUDE.md","estimate":8,"labels":["feature","epic"],"status":"PLANNED","title":"Rebrand beats as `Exponential` with an `xpo` binary"},"created_at":"2026-06-17T07:24:13.99442145Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-0d978a","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Summary\n\nRebrand from `beats` to **Exponential** (`xpo` binary). Enabling exponentially faster development with AI agents.\n\n## Key Decisions\n\nItemOldNewGo module`github.com/palarix/beatsgithub.com/palarix/exponential`Binary output`beatsxpo`Binary source dir`cmd/beats/cmd/exponential/`Core package dir`internal/beats/internal/exponential/`Core package name`package beatspackage exponential`Data dir`.beats/.exponential/`User config`~/.config/beats/~/.config/exponential/`Env prefix`BEATS_*XPO_*`MCP tools`beats_list`, etc.`exponential_list`, etc.MCP server name`\"beats\"\"exponential\"`Frontend brand\"Beats\"\"Exponential\"Commit prefix`beats:exponential:`Default ID prefix`beats-`folder-derived (fallback `\"exponential-\"`)Skill dirs`claude/skills/beats*claude/skills/exponential*`CSS class`prose-beatsprose-exponential`localStorage keys`beats-*exponential-*`\n\nClean break — no backward compatibility, no migration, no deprecated env var fallbacks.\n\nThe binary is `xpo` but everything else uses the full name `exponential`.\n\n## Scope\n\nSee `rename.md` for the full implementation plan covering all touch points.\n\n## Estimated touch points\n\n- \\~60 Go source files with import/string changes\n- \\~10 frontend files\n- \\~170+ doc references\n- CI workflow, Makefile, Dockerfile, .mcp.json, CLAUDE.md"},"created_at":"2026-06-17T07:27:13.975540697Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
