{"id":"xpo-877d60","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a5849166-b433-4819-a7b3-39786a3271f7","text":"## Summary\n\nCleaned up all remaining \"beats\" references after the rebrand:\n\n- **`web/src/index.css`** — renamed comment from \"BEATS DESIGN SYSTEM\" to \"EXPONENTIAL DESIGN SYSTEM\"\n- **`.gitignore`** — replaced `# Beats binary` / `/beats` / `.beats/issues.snapshot.json` with the `xpo` equivalents\n- **`rename.md`** — deleted the obsolete rebrand planning doc\n- **`xpo-d5719d`** — updated tracker issue title from \"beats\" to \"xpo\"\n\nFinal `grep -ri \"beats\"` across the codebase returns zero hits (excluding the historical CHANGELOG entry). All tests pass."},"created_at":"2026-06-17T11:57:41.193204052Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
