{"id":"xpo-4936b6","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"On WebKit based browsers the scrollbars look ugly. It's using the native (white) scrollbars and gutters instead of our beautifully styled scrollbars that only show when scrolling. What can we do?","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"b2I","title":"Ugly scrollbars on macOS / Safari (WebKit)"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:12:58.021028Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-4936b6","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:12:58.080751Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-4936b6","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:21:33.163202Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-4936b6","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2aa5cd8e-5400-48e3-8d04-213c6f09c7cf","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed ugly native white scrollbars on Safari/WebKit by addressing several root causes:\n\n- **Added `color-scheme: dark`** on `:root` in `index.css` — tells browsers the UI is dark so native controls (scrollbars, form elements) render in dark mode\n- **Separated webkit and standard scrollbar CSS** — `::-webkit-scrollbar` rules (unguarded) provide custom shapes for Chromium and older Safari; standard `scrollbar-width` + `scrollbar-color` inside `@supports (scrollbar-color: auto)` for Safari 26.2+ and Firefox, which per spec ignores the legacy webkit rules\n- **Removed duplicate scrollbar block** with hardcoded `rgba(255,255,255,...)` colors that was overriding the theme-aware styles\n- **Removed `scrollbar-gutter: stable`** from `IssueDetail.tsx` — it forced a permanent visible gutter on WebKit\n- **Removed `auto-hide-scrollbar` CSS class** — the hover-reveal trick conflicted with native overlay behavior; macOS overlay scrollbars auto-hide natively\n- **Added `overscroll-contain`** on `DistributionSection` to prevent scroll chaining to the page\n- **Added `pr-2`** padding on `DistributionSection` for spacing between content and scrollbar\n\n### Files changed\n\n- `web/src/index.css` — scrollbar strategy rewrite, `color-scheme: dark`\n- `web/src/components/ui/Modal.tsx` — (prior commit) focus stealing fix\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx` — removed `scrollbar-gutter: stable`\n- `web/src/components/Dashboard/DistributionSection.tsx` — `overscroll-contain`, `pr-2`, removed `auto-hide-scrollbar`"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:33:44.313624Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
