{"id":"xpo-11dfd1","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Redesign the Notifications/Inbox view as a two-panel layout inspired by the inbox view.\n\n## Left panel — notification cards\n\n- **One card per issue**, regardless of how many events occurred (status changes, comments, assignments, etc.)\n- Cards show the issue title, primary label, and a short summary of the latest change\n- Unread indicator for issues with unseen activity\n- Sorted by most recent activity\n- Clicking a card selects it and marks it as read\n\n## Right panel — issue detail\n\n- Renders the full issue detail for the selected notification card\n- Users can read context and act (comment, update status, assign) without navigating away from the inbox\n\n## Interaction\n\n- Keyboard navigation (j/k or arrow keys) to move through cards\n- Bulk mark-all-read preserved\n- Selecting a card highlights it in the left panel and loads the issue on the right","labels":["feature","WebApp"],"title":"Rework Inbox into split-pane notification center"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:43:10.731641Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-11dfd1","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"Redesign the Notifications/Inbox view as a two-panel layout inspired by the inbox view.\n\n## Left panel — notification cards\n\n- **One card per issue**, regardless of how many events occurred (status changes, comments, assignments, etc.)\n- Cards show the issue title, primary label, and relative time of latest activity\n- Unread indicator for issues with unseen activity\n- Sorted by most recent activity\n- Clicking a card selects it and marks it as read\n\n## Right panel — issue detail\n\n- **Change summary banner** at the top — a subtle highlighted strip summarizing what changed since last read (e.g. \"Status changed to Done, 2 new comments, reassigned to Jake\"). Provides immediate context before the full issue renders below.\n- Full issue detail rendering beneath the banner\n- Users can read context and act (comment, update status, assign) without navigating away from the inbox\n\n## Interaction\n\n- Keyboard navigation (j/k or arrow keys) to move through cards\n- Bulk mark-all-read preserved\n- Selecting a card highlights it in the left panel and loads the issue on the right","sort_order":"a2","status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:46:31.02669Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-e26df1","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Add a personal \"My Issues\" view to the sidebar, showing issues relevant to the current user.\n\n## Tabs\n\n- **Assigned** — issues where the current user is the assignee\n- **Created** — issues created by the current user\n\n## Layout\n\n- Flat issue list (no grouping), one row per issue\n- Each row shows: issue ID, status icon, title, linked PR/branch (if any), labels, assignee avatar, and date\n- Sorted by most recent activity by default\n- Priority indicator on the left edge of each row\n\n## Interaction\n\n- Clicking a row navigates to the issue detail view\n- Tab selection persists across navigation (remembers last active tab)\n- Respect existing filters/sort if we add them later","labels":["feature","WebApp"],"title":"Add \"My Issues\" view with Assigned / Created tabs"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:45:05.960432Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-061e35","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Display branch and PR associations as compact badges on issue rows in list views (backlog, board, My Issues).\n\n## Behavior\n\n- When an issue has a linked git branch or PR, show a small badge with a branch/PR icon and identifier (e.g. `#54910`)\n- Badge appears inline in the issue row, between the title and labels\n- Clicking the badge could link to the PR if a remote URL is available\n\n## Data source\n\nRequires detecting branch-to-issue associations — likely by matching branch names that contain the issue ID (e.g. `xpo-abc123/fix-thing`) or via explicit metadata if available.","labels":["feature","WebApp"],"title":"Show linked branch/PR badges on issue rows"},"created_at":"2026-06-18T09:46:19.891882Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.179 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
