{"id":"xpo-f12313","type":"CREATE","payload":{"dependencies":[{"kind":"depends_on","source_id":"xpo-f12313","target_id":"xpo-e282c2"}],"description":"Implement `AgentExecutor` for popular AI coding agents beyond the built-in `ClaudeExecutor`. Each executor handles agent-specific CLI invocation, output parsing, and usage/token tracking.\n\nThe `GenericExecutor` already works as a fallback for any agent that accepts a prompt argument, but dedicated executors can leverage agent-specific features (structured output, usage stats, streaming).","labels":["epic"],"status":"BACKLOG","title":"Agent executor implementations"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T12:51:01.609078Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
