{"id":"xpo-3e5244","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Replace drive summary with implementation walkthrough","description":"## Summary\n\nReplace the current `xpo drive` summary step (a brief changelog-style paragraph) with a structured walkthrough that explains the implementation like a senior engineer would to a junior or PM. Builds trust by making the reasoning verifiable.\n\n## Walkthrough sections\n\n1. **Rationale** — why this approach, what alternatives were considered\n2. **Changes** — file-by-file walkthrough of what changed and why\n3. **Decisions** — non-obvious choices or tradeoffs made\n4. **How to verify** — steps to test, commands to run, what to look for\n5. **Risks** — anything the reviewer should watch out for\n\n## Implementation\n\n- Replace `buildSummaryPrompt` with `buildWalkthroughPrompt`\n- Feed it spec, diff, test output, and test command\n- Update the xpo comment format\n- Terminal output: render the walkthrough with section headers (word-wrapped)\n- Rename the \"Summary\" phase to \"Walkthrough\"","status":"PLANNED","estimate":2,"dependencies":[{"source_id":"xpo-3e5244","target_id":"xpo-e282c2","kind":"depends_on"}],"labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-06-21T15:33:28.937389Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
