{"id":"xpo-492476","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a4db12ac-240a-4db3-98d0-ca22ed7da93f","text":"Superseded by xpo-9253d8 — the automation rework removes read-time inference entirely, making this design question moot. Ghost parent rendering (xpo-def976) replaces the need for inferred status display."},"created_at":"2026-06-21T16:45:43.151154Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
