{"id":"xpo-d8fd89","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"When attempt to drag an epic with sub-issue, an issue or a sub-issue into a status section on the Issues view that is empty, no drop target is offered and the status cannot be changed.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"b2s","title":"Cannot drag and drop into empty status group"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T16:57:10.035042Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e"}
