{"id":"xpo-d8fd89","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-42493cd9-ef0e-4393-a1a4-a364be9e05fe","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed drag-and-drop into empty/collapsed status groups.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **`DndComponents.tsx`**: Collision detection now uses `pointerWithin` first to check if the pointer is directly over a group header — if so, that group wins immediately without competing against nearby issue rows via `closestCenter`.\n- **`Backlog.tsx`** (`handleDndOver`): Empty groups now show the group highlight (ring + tinted background) as a drop target, regardless of whether the dragged issue is in the same or different status group.\n- **`Backlog.tsx`** (`handleDndMove`): Simplified the group header logic to match."},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:03:13.38826Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-d8fd89","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:03:13.511263Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-33e051","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:05:21.381129Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-33e051","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7ba8d84b-79e6-483b-a868-e6e190eb03e6","text":"## Summary\n\nRemoved all old automation flags and read-time inference. Replaced with new `first_start`/`last_completed` config fields (both default false, implementation in follow-on stories).\n\n### Removed\n- **Config**: `auto_complete_parent`, `auto_close_sub_issues`, `auto_progress_sub_issues`, `auto_progress_parent` → replaced with `first_start`, `last_completed`\n- **projection.go**: removed `applyAutomations` read-time inference for parent status (auto-complete, auto-progress). Branch inference for DOING kept.\n- **update.go**: removed \"cannot complete parent with incomplete children\" guard, auto-close children cascade, auto-progress children cascade\n- **Tests**: removed 6 tests for old automation behavior, added `TestUpdateIssue_ParentCanCompleteWithIncompleteChildren`\n- Updated `setup.go`, `demo.go`, `test_helpers_test.go`, `client_test.go`\n\n### Kept\n- `InferredStatus` field and `is_inferred` in API responses — still used by branch inference for DOING\n- Blocked-by dependency check on DOING transition"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:11:20.512004Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
