{"id":"xpo-a113aa","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:24:42.607122Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-a113aa","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-dfac6ca4-def8-4cd4-83a0-6740f186c6f4","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented first-start trigger in `update.go`. When `automations.first_start` is true and a child transitions to DOING or BLOCKED, the parent is auto-moved to DOING if it's still in BACKLOG or PLANNED. Emits a real UPDATE event with an \"Auto-started parent\" message.\n\nThree tests added: trigger fires, trigger off (no effect), trigger skips already-DOING parent."},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:25:38.714175Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
