{"id":"xpo-33234e","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:28:22.90078Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
{"id":"xpo-33234e","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-688e0544-053c-44ec-81f3-7ab0f0d603fd","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented last-completed trigger in `update.go`. When `automations.last_completed` is true and a child transitions to DONE, checks if all siblings are also DONE — if so, emits a real UPDATE event moving the parent to DONE. Only fires when the parent is in DOING status.\n\nFour tests added: trigger fires on last child, trigger skips when siblings remain, trigger off (no effect), trigger skips non-DOING parent."},"created_at":"2026-06-21T17:29:19.198972Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.185 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
