{"id":"xpo-722df2","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0584d063-5bc2-47ff-b87f-0af89062e7f4","text":"## Summary\n\nIntroduced a new design token `--color-border-label: #404040` for label badge outlines and updated `LabelBadge` to use it.\n\n### Changes\n\n- `web/src/index.css` — added `--color-border-label: #404040` to the border tokens in `@theme`\n- `web/src/components/ui/Badge.tsx` — changed `LabelBadge` border from `--color-border-default` (`#282828`) to `--color-border-label` (`#404040`)"},"created_at":"2026-06-29T07:34:58.454103547Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.193 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
