{"id":"xpo-e26df1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-54ab8438-a809-44f2-b272-ed3b8e65bf02","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded the \"My Issues\" view with two tabs — **Assigned to Me** and **Created by Me**.\n\n### New file\n- `web/src/components/MyIssues/MyIssues.tsx` — lazy-loaded view component\n\n### Modified files\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — added `my-issues` to View type, route maps, labels, keyboard shortcut (`g m`), lazy import, render case, filter/tab state management, and status bar filter chips\n- `web/src/components/Layout/Layout.tsx` — added `my-issues` to View type, `UserIcon` import, and sidebar nav item\n\n### Feature details\n- **Assigned tab** — issues where current user's email matches assignee\n- **Created tab** — issues where current user's email matches creator\n- **Filters** — reuses Backlog's `FilterMenu`, `BacklogFilters`, and `FilterChips` infrastructure; filter state persisted per-tab in localStorage\n- **Keyboard shortcuts** — `g m` navigates to the view, `f` toggles filter menu, `Escape` closes it\n- **Sorted by `updated_at`** descending (most recent activity first)\n- **Flat list** — each row shows priority, ID, status icon, title, branch stats, labels, assignee avatar, date\n- **Tab persistence** — last selected tab stored in localStorage\n- **Empty state** — contextual message per tab, adjusts when filters are active\n- **Lazy-loaded** — ~3 kB chunk, only fetched when the view is visited"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T08:36:55.998331Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.195 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
