{"id":"xpo-11dfd1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c27318af-2bd8-45c6-af97-3757d70af360","text":"## Summary\n\nReworked the Inbox into a split-pane notification center.\n\n### Left panel (320px, 384px on xl)\n- Notification cards grouped by issue, sorted by most recent activity\n- Each card shows: status icon, issue ID (top-left), relative time (top-right), title, labels\n- Selected card highlighted with `--color-surface-2`\n- Keyboard navigation: `j`/`k` or arrow keys to move, `f` to toggle filters, `r` to mark all read\n\n### Right panel\n- IssueDetail's breadcrumb/nav bar at top\n- Change summary banner below (using `--color-surface-2` to stand out), showing all status transitions, comments, assignments since last read\n- Full embedded IssueDetail with inline actions (comment, status, assign, etc.)\n- Prev/next navigation scoped to inbox groups\n\n### Filters\n- Reuses Backlog's `FilterMenu` and `BacklogFilters` infrastructure for consistency\n- Filter dimensions: status, assignee, priority, labels, epic\n- Filter state lifted to App.tsx, persisted in localStorage\n- `FilterChips` in the status bar for easy one-click clearing\n- Filter sub-menus now prefer opening to the right when space allows\n\n### Other changes\n- Tabs removed — focused solely on new/unread notifications\n- \"Mark all read\" clears the right panel selection\n- `IssueDetail` gained an optional `banner` prop for injecting content between the top bar and body\n- New `--color-border-control` design token (`#404040`) for checkbox borders in popovers\n- Sidebar nav reordered: Overview, My Issues, Notifications, Issues, Board, Cycles, Labels, Dependencies\n- Keyboard help (`?`) updated: added `G M` for My Issues, reordered shortcuts to match sidebar, updated Notifications section, moved close hint to far right\n- Filter sub-menu positioning: now prefers right side when viewport space allows, falls back to left"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T09:27:38.978175438Z","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg <nicbet@gmail.com>","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.195 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e"}
