{"id":"xpo-061e35","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-443a12ef-66a7-40da-b988-59cbbbd21eca","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `BranchBadge` component and applied it across all views.\n\n### New component\n- `web/src/components/ui/BranchBadge.tsx` — pill badge matching label styling (`rounded-2xl`, `border-label`), always shows `GitBranch` icon + short SHA (6 chars), appends `| N` commit count when commits exist\n\n### Views updated\n- **Backlog** — replaced inline `GitCommitVertical` rendering with `BranchBadge`, now also shows 0-commit branches\n- **My Issues** — same replacement\n- **Board cards** — added `BranchBadge` (was completely missing)\n- **Issue Detail PropertySidebar** — branch card now shows for 0-commit branches, SHA badge uses `GitBranch` icon with label border styling, layout reordered: badge + label top row, branch name below, stats below that"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T10:55:34.843296822Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.196 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
