{"id":"xpo-797c59","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0915d55f-c203-4155-a3bc-3598750c120f","text":"## Summary\n\nBoth `xpo init` and `xpo doctor` now ensure `.xpo/.gitignore` exists with `git.lock`.\n\n### Changes\n- `internal/exponential/setup.go` — `InitProject` creates `.xpo/.gitignore` as step 3 (before issues.db)\n- `cmd/exponential/doctor.go` — checks for `.xpo/.gitignore`, auto-creates it if missing with a diagnostic message"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T11:03:40.293721021Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.196 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
