{"id":"xpo-797c59","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a3fdcab3-7904-454a-a969-023bcd238d89","text":"## Summary\n\nConsolidated to a single root `.gitignore` for xpo runtime files.\n\n### Changes\n- `cmd/exponential/doctor.go` — checks root `.gitignore` for required entries (`.xpo/issues.snapshot.json`, `.xpo/git.lock`), appends any missing ones\n- `internal/exponential/setup.go` — reverted `.xpo/.gitignore` approach; `InitProject` already handles root `.gitignore` entries\n- Removed `.xpo/.gitignore` — redundant with root `.gitignore`\n- Added `.xpo/git.lock` to this project's root `.gitignore`"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T11:07:31.35687193Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.196 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
