{"id":"xpo-564cdb","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"The default mode should be for the agent to leave the work they have done on a branch for the user to be able to review with the Merge view. Optionally, we could make the default behaviour configurable.","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b54","title":"Change --no-merge flag to --merge and invert logic for `xpo drive`"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T11:54:25.253857873Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
