{"id":"xpo-e8b3cd","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"The spec evaluation takes a long time. The agent may be doing other steps (exploring code base, ...) that are hidden? IN any case we need to take a look at this.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"b54","title":"Evaluating spec during `xpo drive` takes a very long time"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T11:55:25.190849296Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
