{"id":"xpo-0a7c15","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Currently `xpo drive` rewrites the story description with a spec so the original story is lost, and walkthroughs are only printed on the terminal. We should leverage those to become first-class artifacts on issues. Ideally stored as markdown/text files adjacent to issues.db in the .xpo/ folder so they traveltogether with the code.","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b54","title":"Specs and Walkthroughs should be separate artifacts attached to issues"},"created_at":"2026-06-30T11:57:25.411996047Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
