{"id":"xpo-adc4ed","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-5c2b858e-ad71-4a7e-af0c-64c1cccee67d","text":"## Summary\n\nReplaced all custom inline SVG icons with direct `lucide-react` imports across the entire frontend. The `web/src/components/ui/icons.tsx` barrel file has been deleted — consumers now import Lucide components directly where needed.\n\n### What changed\n\n- **Deleted** `web/src/components/ui/icons.tsx` (260-line barrel of 30 hand-crafted inline SVGs)\n- **Removed** `export * from './icons'` from `web/src/components/ui/index.ts`\n- **Updated 16+ files** to import directly from `lucide-react` with explicit `size` props matching the original dimensions\n- **Eliminated all inline SVG fallback paths** in `Timeline.tsx` and `ActivityFeed.tsx` activity icon maps — every activity type now uses a Lucide component\n- **Removed** `EstimateIcon` from `IssueDetail/icons.tsx` (replaced with Lucide `Triangle`); kept `PriorityIcon` as the only remaining custom icon (genuinely unique bar-chart visualization)\n\n### Icon choices refined\n\n- Commits: `GitCommitVertical`\n- Comments: `MessageSquareMore`\n- Description updates: `SquareDashedBottomCode`\n- Status planned: `CircleDot`\n- Remaining activity types: `Pencil` (rename), `Tag` (labels), `TriangleAlert` (priority)\n\n### Visual polish\n\n- Timeline activity circles switched from outlined (`ring-1`) to subtle tinted backgrounds matching the activity color hue\n- Timeline day headers now use a `Calendar` icon instead of a `●` bullet, center-aligned with the date label and summary\n- StatusIcon bumped from `size={14}` to `size={16}` in PropertySidebar for consistent alignment with other meta icons\n- All Lucide icons given explicit `size` props to prevent Lucide's 24px default from oversizing them\n\n### What stayed custom\n\n- `StatusIcon` — domain-specific circle variants (dashed, half-filled, checkmark) with semantic status colors\n- `PriorityIcon` — bar-chart visualization with dynamic fill based on priority level\n- Two small inline SVGs in `ContextMenu.tsx` (status half-circle, priority bars) — no Lucide equivalents"},"created_at":"2026-07-03T07:52:49.468851118Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.195 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
