{"id":"xpo-a7cc05","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-4f9e4a0c-9af1-45ed-b7cd-aae02ef46007","text":"## Summary\n\nRemoved the hard-coded `w-24` (96px) fixed width and `truncate` from the `CopyableId` column in `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`. The column now sizes to its content exactly via `shrink-0`, so short prefixes don't leave dead space and long prefixes don't get clipped."},"created_at":"2026-07-03T08:07:52.163074741Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.195 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
