{"id":"xpo-6f1db9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-5a01944d-e6f4-4ffe-abe5-6eb895fab921","text":"## Implementation Summary\n\nRegistered three new MCP tools and extended `xpo__show` output with artifact metadata.\n\n### What changed\n\n**`internal/mcpserver/tools.go`** — all changes in a single file:\n\n**New input/output types** — `specIn`/`specOut`, `walkthroughIn`/`walkthroughOut`, `artifactIn`/`artifactOut` with consistent `{ ok, issue_id, path, content?, error? }` envelope. Shared `artifactOutEntry` type for artifact summaries (used by both `artifact list` and `show`).\n\n**`xpo__spec` tool** — operations: `write`, `read`, `delete`. Filename is always `spec.md`, never caller-specified. Delegates to `Client.WriteSpec`/`ReadSpec`/`DeleteSpec`.\n\n**`xpo__walkthrough` tool** — identical schema to `spec`. Filename is always `walkthrough.md`. Delegates to `Client.WriteWalkthrough`/`ReadWalkthrough`/`DeleteWalkthrough`.\n\n**`xpo__artifact` tool** — operations: `add`, `read`, `delete`, `list`. Requires `filename` for add/read/delete. Reserved filenames (`spec.md`, `walkthrough.md`) are rejected by the business logic layer with an error directing the caller to the dedicated tool. Delegates to `Client.AddArtifact`/`ReadArtifact`/`DeleteArtifact`/`ListArtifacts`.\n\n**`xpo__show` extension** — added `Artifacts []artifactOutEntry` field to `showOut`. Populated from `issue.Artifacts` via new `toArtifactEntries()` helper. Empty array when no artifacts exist.\n\nAll mutation handlers call `t.broadcast(\"ARTIFACT\", issueID)` so the web UI can pick up live updates.\n\n### Test coverage\n\n9 new tests in `tools_test.go`:\n- `TestSpecWriteReadDelete` — full write→read→show→delete→read-after-delete cycle\n- `TestSpecRequiresContent` — rejects empty content on write\n- `TestSpecInvalidOperation` — rejects unknown operations\n- `TestWalkthroughWriteReadDelete` — full lifecycle\n- `TestArtifactAddReadDeleteList` — add→list→read→delete→list-after-delete\n- `TestArtifactRejectsReservedFilenames` — confirms `spec.md` and `walkthrough.md` are blocked\n- `TestArtifactRequiresFilename` — rejects add/read/delete without filename\n- `TestArtifactInvalidOperation` — rejects unknown operations\n- `TestShowArtifactsEmptyByDefault` — verifies empty artifacts array on fresh issues\n\n### Verification\n\n- `go test ./internal/mcpserver/ -v` — all 9 new + all existing tests pass\n- `make build` — succeeds\n- `make test` — full suite passes, no regressions"},"created_at":"2026-07-03T13:05:40.821415801Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.199 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
