{"id":"xpo-75e913","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8b0d185a-6156-4269-b1cf-d2ba2a72abe0","text":"## Implementation Summary\n\nSurfaced artifact metadata across all web UI surfaces plus backend event filters.\n\n### Backend changes\n\n**`internal/exponential/timeline.go`** — Added `EventTypeArtifact` to `IsMeaningfulActivityEvent` so artifact events appear in the dashboard activity feed and timeline.\n\n**`internal/exponential/inbox.go`** — Added `EventTypeArtifact` to `isMeaningfulInboxEvent` so artifact events appear in the inbox. Added `EventTypeArtifact` case to `FormatInboxItem` rendering \"{who} {action} {filename} on {id}\".\n\n**`internal/server/responses.go`** — Added `ArtifactResponse` struct and `Artifacts []ArtifactResponse` field to `IssueResponse`. Populated from `issue.Artifacts` in `issueToResponse`.\n\n### Frontend changes\n\n**`web/src/api/types.ts`** — Added `ArtifactSummary` interface, `artifacts?: ArtifactSummary[]` to `Issue`, added `'ARTIFACT'` to `InboxItem.type` union.\n\n**`web/src/api/client.ts`** — Added `'ARTIFACT'` to `ActivityEvent.type` union.\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/ArtifactList.tsx`** — New component showing artifact list with type-specific icons (FileText for spec, BookOpen for walkthrough, Paperclip for generic), filename, author, and relative timestamp.\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`** — Inserted `\u003cArtifactList\u003e` between SubIssuesTable and ActivityTimeline.\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/ActivityTimeline.tsx`** — Added `ARTIFACT` case to `describeEvent` rendering \"{action} {filename}\" with monospace filename styling.\n\n**`web/src/components/Dashboard/ActivityFeed.tsx`** — Added `artifact` to `ActIconKey` union, Paperclip icon mapping, and `ARTIFACT` case to `describeActivity`.\n\n**`web/src/components/Inbox/Inbox.tsx`** — Added `ARTIFACT` case to `buildChangeSummary` rendering \"{filename} {action}\".\n\n**`web/src/components/Board/BoardCard.tsx`** — Added artifact indicator icons (FileText, BookOpen, Paperclip) in the bottom row, only shown when the issue has the corresponding artifact type.\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`** — Same artifact indicator icons after the branch badge in backlog rows.\n\n### Verification\n\n- `bunx tsc --noEmit` — clean type check\n- `make build` — succeeds\n- `make test` — full suite passes, no regressions"},"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:35:45.389186591Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.199 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-75e913","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"walkthrough","filename":"walkthrough.md","action":"created"},"created_at":"2026-07-03T14:40:39.59720903Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.199 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-75e913","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3a5e78ec-3a1a-4250-b16e-bb52f6c08cf5","text":"## Implementation Summary\n\nFull artifact visibility across the web UI, plus a tabbed reading interface and artifact download.\n\n### Backend changes\n\n**`internal/exponential/timeline.go`** — Added `EventTypeArtifact` to `IsMeaningfulActivityEvent`.\n\n**`internal/exponential/inbox.go`** — Added `EventTypeArtifact` to `isMeaningfulInboxEvent`. Added ARTIFACT case to `FormatInboxItem`.\n\n**`internal/server/responses.go`** — Added `ArtifactResponse` struct and `Artifacts` field to `IssueResponse`, populated in `issueToResponse`.\n\n**`internal/server/handlers.go`** — New `handleGetArtifact` handler for `GET /api/issues/{id}/artifacts/{filename}`.\n\n**`internal/server/router.go`** — Registered the new artifact content endpoint.\n\n### Frontend changes\n\n**`web/src/api/types.ts`** — Added `ArtifactSummary` interface, `artifacts` field on `Issue`, `ARTIFACT` to event type unions.\n\n**`web/src/api/client.ts`** — Added `ARTIFACT` to `ActivityEvent.type`, added `fetchArtifactContent` function.\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`** — Tabbed interface: Details/Spec/Walkthrough tabs below the title block. Spec and Walkthrough tabs only appear when the artifact exists. Content fetched on demand. `scrollbar-gutter: stable both-edges` on the scroll container to prevent content shift.\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/ArtifactList.tsx`** — New component with per-type icons (FileCodeCorner for spec, FileBracesCorner for walkthrough, Paperclip for generic). Download button on hover that fetches content and triggers browser save.\n\n**`web/src/components/IssueDetail/ActivityTimeline.tsx`** — ARTIFACT event rendering in activity timeline.\n\n**`web/src/components/Dashboard/ActivityFeed.tsx`** — ARTIFACT event with Paperclip icon in dashboard feed.\n\n**`web/src/components/Inbox/Inbox.tsx`** — ARTIFACT events in inbox change summaries.\n\n**`web/src/components/Board/BoardCard.tsx`** — Paperclip + count badge for artifact indicators.\n\n**`web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`** — Same paperclip + count badge in backlog rows.\n\n### Verification\n\n- `make build` — succeeds\n- `make test` — full suite passes, no regressions\n- Manual verification: tabbed interface, artifact download, card indicators, activity feeds all working"},"created_at":"2026-07-03T15:19:06.853193208Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.199 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
