{"id":"xpo-9c01f2","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-58c88ca2-7339-47fb-9492-2970eb9e8725","text":"## Completion\n\nReplaced the full glamour-rendered walkthrough dump with a one-liner (`log.ok`) pointing to `xpo artifact show \u003cid\u003e --walkthrough`. Removed `driveLogger.walkthrough`, `wordWrap`, and the `glamour` import — no remaining callers. Build and tests pass. Squash-merged to main."},"created_at":"2026-07-03T16:09:51.075918824Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.199 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
