{"id":"xpo-d31711","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7e9e49bb-b5ac-455d-a8f4-9a875bd2fdce","text":"## Summary\n\nChanged `max-w-140` (560px) → `max-w-[860px]` in `web/src/components/CommandPalette/CommandPalette.tsx` line 165 to match the 2xl Modal's `maxWidth` used by the create-new-issue dialog.\n\nThe existing `w-full` class ensures the dialog still scales down gracefully on narrow viewports. No `min-width` was added so the palette remains usable on small screens. No other files were modified.\n\n**Tests**: `make test` passes, `make frontend` builds successfully."},"created_at":"2026-07-04T06:47:13.98356253Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.200 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
