{"id":"xpo-8b54d8","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Improve timeline and activity view precision","description":"The timeline and issue activity views have three rendering issues surfaced during the redundant-DONE cleanup:\n\n## 1. Merge activity says \"and closed this issue\"\n\nThe merge activity entry renders \"merged … via squash **and closed this issue**\", but there is now a separate explicit DONE/status-change event (with the green checkmark icon) that serves as the scannable closure signal. The \"and closed\" text on the merge entry is redundant and should be removed.\n\n## 2. Timeline commit uses issue title instead of branch name\n\nThe timeline renders commits as \"committed 78979f9 on **Make global command dialog wider**\" (the issue title). Since the commit happens on the branch, it should show the branch name instead.\n\n## 3. Actor attribution: agents vs principals\n\nEvents have `created_by` (the actor) and `on_behalf_of` (the principal/user), but `on_behalf_of` is never surfaced in the UI. Currently agents appear as first-class entities (\"claude merged …\") when logically the user is the accountable entity and the agent is the mechanism.\n\n**Desired model:**\n- Primary actor = `on_behalf_of` when present, otherwise `created_by`\n- Secondary attribution = \"via {agent}\" when `on_behalf_of` is present\n- Example: \"Nicolas Bettenburg merged … via claude\" instead of \"claude merged …\"\n- Events without `on_behalf_of` render as today (direct user action)\n\n**Prerequisite:** `xpo drive` and `xpo merge` (when invoked by an agent) must set `on_behalf_of` on the events they create — currently only MCP-originated events populate this field.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":3,"sort_order":"b5q","labels":["improvement"]},"created_at":"2026-07-04T07:38:57.589190694Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.200 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-8b54d8","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"spec","filename":"spec.md","action":"created"},"created_at":"2026-07-04T07:39:18.024661074Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.200 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-8b54d8","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-07-04T07:39:58.74771191Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.200 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-8b54d8","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7e39dccd-d87b-4bb5-bf9b-4bbed07f1bdf","text":"## Summary\n\nImproved timeline, activity feed, and issue detail rendering across four areas:\n\n### 1. Merge activity — removed redundant \"and closed this issue\"\nRemoved from `ActivityTimeline.tsx`. The separate DONE event with the green checkmark serves as the closure signal.\n\n### 2. Timeline commits — branch name instead of issue title\nCommit entries now show the branch name since the commit happens on the branch, not the issue.\n\n### 3. Actor attribution — agent-first with owner tooltip\n- Agent-mediated events show the agent name (e.g. `claude-code/2.1.200`) as the primary actor\n- Hovering the name shows the owner (e.g. `Nicolas Bettenburg`) via an instant Radix tooltip\n- Direct user actions render unchanged (no tooltip)\n- Added `displayActor()` utility in `format.ts` to resolve `created_by` / `on_behalf_of`\n- Added `@radix-ui/react-tooltip` with a `Tooltip` component and zero-delay `TooltipProvider`\n\n### 4. Backend: `on_behalf_of` plumbing\n- `on_behalf_of` added to `HistoryEvent`, `ActivityEvent`, `TimelineEntry` types (TS) and server responses (`handlers.go`, `timeline.go`)\n- `cmd/exponential/drive.go` sets `client.OnBehalfOf = client.GetUser()` so all drive events trace back to the user\n- `ProjectIssues` uses `principalOf(evt)` for issue `CreatedBy` — projected issues show the owner, not the agent\n- Backfilled `on_behalf_of` on all 642 historical agent events in `issues.db`\n- Replaced agent assignee values with the principal identity (75 events)\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/ActivityTimeline.tsx` — removed \"and closed\", agent-first rendering with tooltip\n- `web/src/components/Timeline/Timeline.tsx` — branch name for commits, agent-first with tooltip\n- `web/src/components/Dashboard/ActivityFeed.tsx` — agent-first with tooltip\n- `web/src/utils/format.ts` — `displayActor()` utility\n- `web/src/components/ui/Tooltip.tsx` — new Radix tooltip component\n- `web/src/main.tsx` — `TooltipProvider` wrapper\n- `web/src/api/client.ts`, `web/src/api/types.ts` — `on_behalf_of` on event types\n- `internal/server/handlers.go` — `on_behalf_of` in history and activity responses\n- `internal/exponential/timeline.go` — `OnBehalfOf` on `TimelineEntry`\n- `internal/exponential/projection.go` — `principalOf()` for issue `CreatedBy`\n- `internal/mcpserver/tools_test.go` — updated test expectation for principal resolution\n- `cmd/exponential/drive.go` — sets `OnBehalfOf` on client\n- `.xpo/issues.db` — backfilled `on_behalf_of` and fixed agent assignees"},"created_at":"2026-07-04T08:47:45.39166168Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.200 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
