{"id":"xpo-2f62a3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-c74a51fe-0459-4c0e-a5c1-70ea56482fb5","text":"## Summary\n\nRewrote `AGENTS.md` to align with the current MCP-based workflow documented in `CLAUDE.md`.\n\n### What changed\n\n- **MCP tool table** added at the top — replaces all CLI command examples as the primary interface. The CLI reference in `claude/skills/` is noted as supplemental material for downstream users.\n- **6-step workflow** (Discover → Plan → Start → Implement \u0026 test → Document → Complete) replaces the old 7-step bash script.\n- **Dependency checking** added as strict rule #3 — agents must inspect `depends_on`/`blocked_by` before starting.\n- **Specs and Walkthroughs** section added — read specs before implementation, write walkthroughs after, use artifacts for supplemental files.\n- **Completion comments** section added with guidance on structure (summary, rationale, continuation context).\n- **Build instructions** updated to include `bun`/`bunx` preference.\n\n### Rationale\n\nThe old file was written when `xpo` was CLI-only. Now that an MCP server is registered, agents should use MCP tools directly. The new content mirrors `CLAUDE.md` structure so both files stay consistent and agent-agnostic."},"created_at":"2026-07-09T08:15:51.055522Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.205 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-2f62a3","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"walkthrough","filename":"walkthrough.md","action":"created"},"created_at":"2026-07-09T08:15:57.648286Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.205 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-2f62a3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-14fef7a0-0d30-4c33-8665-7c0e04bdf529","text":"## Correction — actual fix\n\nThe earlier comment described updating `AGENTS.md` in this repo, but the issue is really about the template in `GenerateAgentDocs()` at `internal/exponential/agents.go` — the instructions that `xpo doctor` renders into other projects' agent files.\n\n### What changed in `GenerateAgentDocs()`\n\n- **MCP tool table** replaces all CLI command examples as the primary interface\n- **6-step workflow** (Discover → Plan → Start → Implement \u0026 test → Document → Complete) replaces the old CLI-based workflow\n- **Dependency checking** added as strict rule #3\n- **Specs and Walkthroughs section** added — read specs before implementation, write walkthroughs after, use artifacts for supplemental files\n- **Completion comments section** added with structure guidance\n- **Removed repo-specific build instructions** (`make build` / binary name) — the generated instructions are for downstream projects, not this repo\n- `prefix` parameter is now unused (was only needed for the removed build section)\n\n### Also updated\n\n- `AGENTS.md` in this repo — rewritten to match the current MCP-based workflow (separate from the generated template)"},"created_at":"2026-07-09T08:20:30.357033Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.205 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
