{"id":"xpo-46a120","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Currently, the dashboard shows past week total story points with a trend vs. the week before that. Users liked the old display better where it would compare their current week (running total) vs. last completed week (total). We should keep the trend arrow, but only for completed last week vs. the week before that (skip arrow if no 2 weeks history available)","labels":["improvement"],"sort_order":"b70","title":"Dashboard: Show cumulative story points for current week"},"created_at":"2026-07-11T07:34:13.208249Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-46a120","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"sort_order":"Zy","status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-07-11T07:34:22.507524Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-e5865f","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"We should port back best practices from this repo into the `xpo init` process:\n\n- Writing better specs (AiSE Kit style) out of the box\n- Software process guard-rails \n  - Search for duplicate issues before filing new ones\n  - Creating bug issues for bugs found\n  - Linking dependencies\n  - Before implementing an issue, ensure it's Planned and has a spec\n  - Before creating a spec or starting implementation also take comments into account\n  - Adding completion comments\n  - Adding walkthrough after implementation\n- MCP tool instructions","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b70","title":"Improved agent instructions out of the box"},"created_at":"2026-07-11T07:37:40.145593Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-e5865f","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"sort_order":"ZyV","status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-07-11T07:37:44.051551Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-8204d6","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Now that Exponential is out in the wild we'd like some very basic telemetry that also ensure anonymity. The plan is to load the logo image (with a fallback to local) for the web ui from our CDN (with a `?version=` param). \n\n- Telemetry is opt-out by setting EXPONENTIAL_DISABLE_TELEMETRY environment variable or in `.xpo/config.yml`\n- Ensure we add clear messaging to the [README.md](http://README.md) about telemetry, what and how we track and how to opt out\n- Ensure we add a clear message to `xpo init` about telemetry and how to opt out\n\nThe goal here is to have a light-weight, privacy respecting way for tracking adoption.","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b70","title":"Adding Telemtry"},"created_at":"2026-07-11T07:40:48.208994Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-8204d6","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"sort_order":"ZyV"},"created_at":"2026-07-11T07:40:56.528769Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
