{"id":"xpo-b44c4c","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"sort_order":"Zyt"},"created_at":"2026-07-12T06:27:21.829004Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-df91c4","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"In all input fields that support Markdown, we should show a formatting bar (popover) when a user has an active text selection. \n\nOptions in the formatting bar should be:\n\n- \"Text type\" (Body Text, heading 1, heading 2, heading 3, heading 4), \n\n\n- Bold, Italic, Strikethrough, Underline\n- Link\n- Quote\n- Inline Code\n- Code block\n- List (Numbered, Ordered, Checklist)\n\nEach option should be rendered as an icon button with a representative icon. Some options may in turn open a popover with options (text type, list).","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b7a","title":"Formatting bar for Markdown content"},"created_at":"2026-07-12T06:31:09.4417Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-df91c4","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"sort_order":"ZzO","status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-07-12T06:34:30.805874Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-d662a2","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"We have introduced support for attachments to issues in xpo-0a7c15, but currently there is no way to actually attach files outside of the CLI or MCP commands. We should support attaching files in both the \"Create new issue\" dialog, as well as the Issue detail view.","labels":["feature"],"sort_order":"b8A","title":"Ability to add attachments from Web UI"},"created_at":"2026-07-12T06:34:14.770658Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
