{"id":"xpo-46a120","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e280827c-a553-400c-8c02-e1dd4a8cb6b1","text":"## Summary\n\nRefactored the Velocity dashboard card to show a two-column table (last week total | current week running total) with column headers matching Cycle Time / Lead Time cards. Footer shows a colored trend arrow comparing last week vs the week before.\n\n**Backend**: Added `current_week_points` field to the velocity metrics struct, accumulating points for issues completed from Monday of the current week onward.\n\n**Frontend**: \n- Velocity card uses table layout with \"LAST WEEK\" / \"CURRENT\" headers\n- All stat table cards now use inner-only vertical dividers (`border-r` with `--color-border-default`)\n- Staleness card footer alignment fixed (moved outside wrapper div)\n\n**Files changed**: `internal/server/metrics.go`, `internal/server/metrics_test.go`, `web/src/api/client.ts`, `web/src/components/Dashboard/Dashboard.tsx`\n\nAll tests pass, build succeeds. User confirmed layout and data accuracy in browser."},"created_at":"2026-07-12T07:30:22.276134Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
