{"id":"xpo-e5865f","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7f40466d-b894-4945-b540-1764cdf9b658","text":"## Summary\n\nReplaced the body of `GenerateAgentDocs()` in `internal/exponential/agents.go` with the new \"AiSE light\" agent instructions template.\n\n**Key changes from the old template:**\n- Added \"Spec (Think Before You Build)\" section with two-tier guidance (brief for bugs, full for features)\n- Added \"Walkthrough (After User Review)\" as the durable post-top-hat artifact\n- Split issue creation rules: bugs filed freely, features need user approval\n- Added prioritization guidance (blockers \u003e bugs \u003e features)\n- Added BACKLOG transition rule (ask user before starting)\n- Build/test section uses generic language-agnostic defaults\n- Completion comments are now explicitly brief; walkthrough carries the durable record\n- Reorganized workflow into numbered phases (Discover → Plan → Spec → Start → Implement → Comment → Walkthrough → Complete)\n\n**Tests passing, build succeeds.** Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-12T08:31:23.706849Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-ecbf49","type":"CREATE","payload":{"dependencies":[{"kind":"blocked_by","source_id":"xpo-ecbf49","target_id":"xpo-e5865f"}],"description":"`xpo init` currently only creates the `.xpo` directory, `config.yaml`, `issues.db`, and updates `.gitignore`. It does **not** create `.mcp.json` or agent instruction files (`AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md`).\n\nThese are deferred to `xpo doctor` which requires an interactive terminal and user prompts. A user running `xpo init` expects everything needed for a working setup to be created in one step.\n\n**Expected behavior:** `xpo init` should:\n1. Create `.mcp.json` with the xpo MCP server entry (or add to existing)\n2. Create `AGENTS.md` with the generated agent instructions (via `GenerateAgentDocs()`)\n\nThe interactive `xpo doctor` flow can remain as a way to add instructions to *additional* agent files (e.g. `.cursorrules`, `.clinerules`) that are detected after the fact.","labels":["bug"],"sort_order":"a5","status":"PLANNED","title":"xpo init should create .mcp.json and agent instructions"},"created_at":"2026-07-12T08:34:53.651175Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
