{"id":"xpo-ecbf49","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-80ea1bfb-3d87-444f-8039-4dd94faa72d5","text":"## Summary\n\n`xpo init` now creates `.mcp.json` and `AGENTS.md` as part of initialization, no longer requiring an interactive `xpo doctor` session.\n\n**Changes in `cmd/exponential/init.go`:**\n- After creating `.xpo` directory, calls `EnsureMCPConfig()` to create/update `.mcp.json`\n- Calls `AppendAgentInstructions()` to create `AGENTS.md` with the full agent instructions\n- Checks for existing instructions before appending (idempotent on re-init with `--force`)\n- Reloads config after init to get the freshly-written prefix\n\n**Tests passing, build succeeds, verified idempotent.** Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-07-12T08:39:30.384385Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
