{"id":"xpo-d41e32","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1ba8f7cf-5bb4-401a-99ab-cb00e43cd410","text":"## Summary\n\nThe issue search in `CommandPalette.tsx` used a fuzzy subsequence matcher (`fuzzyMatch`) for issue titles. Typing \"trail\" matched any title where t-r-a-i-l appeared as a subsequence anywhere — 61 false positives out of 300 issues, with the actual matches buried past the 12-result cap.\n\nReplaced with case-insensitive substring matching (`includes`) for issue titles, IDs, and labels. Fuzzy matching is kept for actions and navigation items (short, predictable labels where subsequence matching is useful). \"trail\" now returns 5 relevant results."},"created_at":"2026-07-14T14:38:12.496262Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
