{"id":"xpo-49cbfe","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-b45464f7-c742-4551-952d-2f8d65c1ae2a","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded input validation to all four branches of `handleDraft` in `internal/server/handlers.go`:\n\n- **All branches**: `json.Unmarshal` errors now return 400 instead of being silently ignored.\n- **CREATE**: Validates title non-empty, status against known values, resolves `parent_id` and dependency `target_id` values via `GetIssue()`, validates estimate via `ValidateEstimate()`.\n- **UPDATE**: Validates `issue_id` non-empty, status if provided, resolves `parent_id` and dependency targets.\n- **COMMENT**: Validates `issue_id` and `text` non-empty.\n- **DELETE**: Validates `issue_id` non-empty, handles unmarshal errors.\n\nUses `inputs.ValidateStatus()` for status validation (same function as MCP tools)."},"created_at":"2026-07-15T05:41:22.572779Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
