{"id":"xpo-7868ea","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1a59caa6-08ff-4d1a-aa74-f5375525a392","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded estimate validation to `ValidateUpdatePayload` in `internal/exponential/client.go`:\n- Non-nil estimates \u003e 0 are validated against the configured estimation system via `config.ValidateEstimate()`.\n- Negative estimates are rejected with \"estimate must not be negative\".\n- Zero estimates (clearing the field) are accepted.\n\nAlso added negative estimate rejection to `ValidateCreatePayload` for consistency — previously only the `\u003e 0` path was checked, so negative values slipped through."},"created_at":"2026-07-15T06:18:15.513535Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
