{"id":"xpo-e75d09","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-d2f8e2e5-6520-40ed-b0eb-89159f1aec24","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded cycle_id validation to both `ValidateCreatePayload` and `ValidateUpdatePayload` in `internal/exponential/client.go`.\n\nWhen a non-empty cycle_id is provided:\n- If cycles aren't enabled in config → error \"cycles are not enabled\"\n- If cycles are enabled → validates via `CycleConfig.CycleForID()` which checks YYYY-MM-DD format\n\nEmpty cycle_id (clearing or not set) is accepted without validation. One file changed: `internal/exponential/client.go`."},"created_at":"2026-07-15T09:37:22.02447Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
