{"id":"xpo-75f1cf","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-b6acf221-af8d-480d-8bca-55a52d02403c","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded length limits to all string input fields across three files:\n\n**`internal/exponential/client.go`**:\n- `ValidateCreatePayload` / `ValidateUpdatePayload`: title (500 chars), description (100KB), assignee (200 chars), label names (100 chars each).\n- `AddComment`: comment body (100KB).\n\n**`internal/exponential/artifact.go`**:\n- `writeArtifact`: artifact/spec/walkthrough content (1MB). Covers all artifact types since `WriteSpec`, `WriteWalkthrough`, and `AddArtifact` all delegate to `writeArtifact`.\n\nLimits are defined as exported constants (`MaxTitleLen`, `MaxDescriptionLen`, etc.) so they can be referenced by tests or documentation."},"created_at":"2026-07-15T10:21:46.540582Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.207 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
