{"id":"xpo-a274c0","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-f388db83-2543-4e1a-b155-4435327751e4","text":"## Summary\n\nMade the priority icon clickable in the Backlog view, opening a `PriorityPicker` popover — same pattern as the existing status icon popover.\n\n**Changes in `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`:**\n- Added `PriorityPicker` import\n- Added `\"priority\"` to the `openPopover` type union\n- Added `handleQuickPriority` callback (calls `addDraft` with priority update)\n- Wrapped `PriorityIcon` with button + `Popover` + `PriorityPicker`\n- Added `p` keyboard shortcut to open priority picker on focused row\n\n**Alignment fix across all three pickers** (`PriorityPicker.tsx`, `StatusPicker.tsx`, `EstimatePicker.tsx`):\n- Replaced conditional checkmark/shortcut rendering with a single `w-4` trailing container holding either the check or the number, so both align in the same column."},"created_at":"2026-07-20T07:51:32.573851Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.215 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
