{"id":"xpo-2ba758","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-b95b5901-c0c1-4f96-a040-4af13fa365a6","text":"## Summary\n\nRemoved `_ = prefix` discard in `GenerateAgentStub` and interpolated the prefix into the generated output. The stub now includes a line telling agents the project's issue ID format, e.g.:\n\n\u003e Issue IDs in this project use the prefix `xpo-` (e.g. `xpo-a1b2c3`).\n\nSince `GenerateAgentDocs` calls `GenerateAgentStub`, both functions now use the prefix. All tests pass."},"created_at":"2026-07-20T07:55:27.901741Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.215 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
