{"id":"xpo-4295bf","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Show review view for branches with uncommitted changes","description":"When a branch matching an issue is checked out but has no commits ahead of the base branch, the backlog/board shows a branch indicator but no way to open the merge/review view. If the branch has uncommitted working-tree changes, the user should still be able to open a review view to see the delta — with a clear indication that merging is not possible until the changes are committed.\n\n## Current behavior\n\n- `BranchBadge` renders when `branch_stats` is non-nil (even with 0 commits)\n- \"Merge Branch\" button in `PropertySidebar` requires `commits \u003e 0`\n- Result: branch with only uncommitted changes shows indicator but no review entry point\n\n## Desired behavior\n\n- When the issue's branch is checked out and has uncommitted changes (staged or unstaged), include those stats in `BranchStats` and flag them as uncommitted\n- Show a \"Review Changes\" button in `PropertySidebar` even with 0 commits\n- `MergeView` opens and shows the working-tree diff, but merge is disabled with a message explaining why","status":"PLANNED","priority":2,"sort_order":"bCK","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@nicbet-wsl.local\u003e","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-07-26T13:35:55.699874Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.218 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-4295bf","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"spec","filename":"spec.md","action":"created"},"created_at":"2026-07-26T13:36:31.578841Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.218 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-4295bf","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-07-26T13:36:36.408552Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.218 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-4295bf","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-873846aa-5ada-4cab-960d-85cf3a07d7f3","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented end-to-end support for showing the review view when a branch has only uncommitted (staged/unstaged) working-tree changes and no commits ahead of base.\n\n**Model layer:**\n- Added `HasUncommitted bool` field to `model.BranchStats` (serialized as `has_uncommitted`)\n- Mirrored in the TypeScript `BranchStats` interface\n\n**Backend (`internal/exponential/`):**\n- `computeBranchStats()` now calls `fillUncommittedStats()` when `commits == 0` and the branch is currently checked out — detects both staged and unstaged changes via `git diff --shortstat HEAD` and `git diff --shortstat --cached`\n- Added `GetWorkingTreeDiffText()` and `ListWorkingTreeFilesChanged()` in `review.go`, sharing logic via a new `listFilesChangedFromDiff()` helper\n- Server handlers `handleGetIssueDiff` and `handleGetIssueFiles` now return working-tree diffs when `commits == 0 \u0026\u0026 HasUncommitted`\n\n**Frontend:**\n- `PropertySidebar`: button now shows when `commits \u003e 0 || has_uncommitted`; label is \"Review Changes\" for uncommitted-only, \"Merge Branch\" otherwise\n- `MergeView`: subtitle changes to \"Commit your changes to enable merging\" for uncommitted-only branches; merge button stays disabled via the existing mergeability check\n- `CommitsTab`: added empty state with icon and \"Uncommitted changes are shown in the Files tab\" hint\n- `BranchBadge`: tooltip shows \"uncommitted changes: N files, +X -Y\" instead of \"no commits yet\"; renders an amber dot indicator\n\nAll tests pass, `make build` succeeds."},"created_at":"2026-07-26T13:39:52.796759Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.218 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
