{"id":"xpo-1765ca","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ee962226-fb85-4514-b0b3-13d85fb73dd4","text":"## Summary\n\nImplemented worktree-based `xpo start`. When `worktrees: true` (default), `start` creates a git worktree at `.xpo/worktrees/\u003cbranch\u003e/` instead of checking out in the primary checkout. The hub stays on `main`.\n\n### New/changed files\n\n- **`internal/config/config.go`** — Added `Worktrees bool` (default `true`) and `WorktreeSetup string` fields\n- **`internal/exponential/git.go`** — Added `WorktreeAdd`, `WorktreeAddExisting`, `WorktreeRemove`, `WorktreeList`, `FindWorktreeForBranch`, `WorktreeDir` helpers\n- **`internal/exponential/start.go`** — Rewrote `StartWork` with dual path: worktree (default) or checkout (`--no-wt`). Returns `worktreePath` as new 2nd return value. Runs `worktree_setup` hook after creation.\n- **`internal/exponential/setup.go`** — Added `.xpo/worktrees/` to `.gitignore` entries in `InitProject`. Added `EnsureGitignoreEntry()` utility.\n- **`cmd/exponential/update.go`** — Wired `--no-wt` flag on `startCmd`, updated caller signature\n- **`cmd/exponential/doctor.go`** — Added `.xpo/worktrees/` to required gitignore entries\n- **`internal/mcpserver/tools.go`** — Added `WorktreePath` to `startOut` struct\n- **`internal/exponential/drive.go`** — Updated `StartWork` call signature\n- **`internal/server/handlers.go`** — Updated `StartWork` call signature\n- **`internal/exponential/start_test.go`** — Updated all tests for new signature, added `TestStartWork_Worktree_CreatesWorktree`\n\n### Design decisions\n\n- `--force` with worktrees: removes existing worktree via `git worktree remove --force` + prune, then creates fresh. Clean takeover.\n- `worktree_setup` hook: runs via `sh -c` in the new worktree directory, stdout/stderr forwarded. Failure is a warning, not a fatal error.\n- Config-driven: `c.Config.Worktrees` controls the path. CLI `--no-wt` sets it to false before calling `StartWork`.\n- Existing checkout tests preserved by setting `Worktrees: false` in the test helper config.\n\n### Test results\nAll 10 packages pass. The new `TestStartWork_Worktree_CreatesWorktree` verifies worktree creation, branch naming, hub staying on main, and `FindWorktreeForBranch` lookup."},"created_at":"2026-08-04T11:48:37.696437Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.221 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
