{"id":"xpo-886099","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7726bfbe-7bbb-4415-b0be-f58e9c582f16","text":"## Update\n\nExtended the fix to the **detail view** (`PropertySidebar.tsx`). Changing an epic's status from the detail sidebar now shows the same \"Update sub-issues?\" modal with DONE children excluded.\n\n### Additional changes in `PropertySidebar.tsx`\n\n- `handleStatusChange` now checks for non-DONE children before updating, and shows the move-children modal if any exist.\n- Added `applyStatusChange` callback (mirrors the backlog's logic) for bulk child updates via `addDraft`.\n- Added the same modal UI with the inline completed-issues note.\n"},"created_at":"2026-08-07T09:45:31.035219Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.224 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
