{"id":"xpo-ee99a5","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-152869fa-b89d-42e2-bc27-051a03fc48a0","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed three overflow issues in the \"Update sub-issues?\" preview dialog (both backlog and detail view):\n\n1. **Labels capped at 2** per child row, with a `+N` indicator for extras. Primary labels are ordered first via `splitLabels()` so they always make the cut.\n2. **Titles truncate** — added `flex-1` to the title span so it takes remaining space and truncates with ellipsis.\n3. **Scrollable list** — added `max-h-64 overflow-y-auto` to the child list container.\n\n### Files changed\n\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx` — preview child rows\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/PropertySidebar.tsx` — preview child rows\n"},"created_at":"2026-08-07T10:30:36.013174Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.224 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
