{"id":"xpo-c762f7","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-d2fa647d-f884-4cb6-84d7-093dc7b4104d","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded `.gitattributes` handling for `merge=union` on `issues.db` to both `xpo init` and `xpo doctor`.\n\n### Changes\n\n- **`setup.go`**: `InitProject` now calls `EnsureGitattributesEntry(\".xpo/issues.db merge=union\")` after the `.gitignore` step. Added `EnsureGitattributesEntry()` helper (same pattern as `EnsureGitignoreEntry`).\n- **`doctor.go`**: Added a `.gitattributes` check after the `.gitignore` check. Auto-adds the entry if missing.\n\nBoth `xpo init` and `xpo init --force` ensure the entry exists. Existing `.gitattributes` content is preserved — the entry is only appended if not already present.\n"},"created_at":"2026-08-07T11:46:07.190691Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.224 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
