{"id":"xpo-9859c9","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-08ceb699-ffc8-4366-8248-a4a3ad36511a","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed Alt parent/unparent DnD not working in Active and Backlog views. Three root causes addressed:\n\n1. **Moved nest target evaluation from `handleDndOver` to `handleDndMove`** — `handleDndOver` only fires on target changes, so pressing Alt mid-drag never updated the nest highlight. `handleDndMove` fires continuously, making the nest ring respond immediately to Alt press/release. Extracted `isDescendant` to a shared `useCallback` for reuse.\n\n2. **Fixed ghost parent expanded-redirect** — the \"redirect below expanded parent\" check used `expandedNodes.has(id)`, but ghost parents auto-expand via `isGhostParent` flag in `useBacklogRows`, not via `expandedNodes`. Added `|| overRow.isGhostParent` so the redirect fires correctly for ghost parents.\n\n3. **Added \"Remove from parent\" to context menu** — new menu item with Unlink icon in `ContextMenu.tsx`, visible only for child issues. Gives a discoverable, non-DnD way to unparent in any view.\n\nAlso added Alt to the cross-group bypass (alongside Ctrl/Meta) in both `handleDndOver` and `handleDndMove`, so Alt operations work across status groups."},"created_at":"2026-08-07T12:17:03.652418Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.224 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
