{"id":"xpo-dda39d","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Stage issue artifacts during merge","description":"## Problem\n\n`MergeIssue` in `internal/exponential/merge.go` explicitly stages only `.xpo/issues.db` before committing the merge (line 132). Artifacts written to `.xpo/artifacts/\u003cissue-id\u003e/` (spec, walkthrough, generic artifacts) are never staged, leaving them as untracked files on `main` after merge.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe merge flow at line 132:\n```go\nexec.Command(\"git\", \"-C\", storage.HubRoot(), \"add\", \".xpo/issues.db\").Run()\n```\n\nOnly stages `issues.db`. Artifacts are written to the hub's working tree via the MCP server throughout the workflow, but the merge commit doesn't include them.\n\n## Fix\n\nAfter staging `issues.db`, also stage `.xpo/artifacts/\u003cissue-id\u003e/` if the directory exists. The issue ID is already available as `issue.ID` in the merge function.","status":"PLANNED","estimate":1,"sort_order":"a5","dependencies":[{"source_id":"xpo-dda39d","target_id":"xpo-cf75df","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["bug"]},"created_at":"2026-08-08T13:23:06.072921Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.226 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
