{"id":"xpo-dda39d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-caacbc89-8446-4fa8-905f-9550e980b354","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded one line to `MergeIssue` in `internal/exponential/merge.go` to stage `.xpo/artifacts/\u003cissue-id\u003e/` after staging `issues.db`. Added `path/filepath` import. Updated CHANGELOG.\n\n**Rationale**: Artifacts (spec, walkthrough, generic) are written to the hub working tree via MCP throughout the workflow but were never included in the merge commit. The fix matches the existing pattern — fire-and-forget `git add`, no error check, no-op if the directory doesn't exist.\n\n**Status**: `make test` passes."},"created_at":"2026-08-08T13:24:14.484838Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.226 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
