{"id":"xpo-8f7b7a","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"`xpo init` should update stale agent instructions and use `# Agent Instructions` heading","description":"## Problem\n\nWhen `xpo init` is re-run in a project that already has agent instructions (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, etc.), it detects the `# Exponential Agent Instructions` heading and skips the file entirely — even if the content is outdated (e.g., missing the xpo-workflow skill rule added in a later version).\n\nAdditionally, the heading `# Exponential Agent Instructions` is overly branded. It should be `# Agent Instructions`.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n- Re-running `xpo init` should **replace** the existing agent instructions section with the current version, preserving any user-authored content above or below.\n- The heading should be `# Agent Instructions`.\n- Both the old heading (`# Exponential Agent Instructions`) and the new one (`# Agent Instructions`) should be detected for backward compatibility.\n\n## Files\n\n- `internal/exponential/agents.go` — `GenerateAgentStub`, `DetectAgentFiles`, `AppendAgentInstructions`\n- `cmd/exponential/init.go` — detection check at line 54\n- `cmd/exponential/doctor.go` — uses `DetectAgentFiles` for the same check","status":"PLANNED","sort_order":"a5","labels":["bug"]},"created_at":"2026-08-08T13:37:50.431615Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.226 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-8f7b7a","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"spec","filename":"spec.md","action":"created"},"created_at":"2026-08-08T13:38:08.601534Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.226 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
