{"id":"xpo-78471c","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-1d3f54fc-4897-461e-b01e-936fc11e48bb","text":"No longer reproducible. All three UI creation paths (inline create, new issue modal, sub-issues inline) now call `computeAppendKey` which generates a sort key after the global max — guaranteed to sort last. The underlying sort key computation was hardened after this bug was filed."},"created_at":"2026-08-31T11:00:14.908511Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.251 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
