{"id":"xpo-f12313","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"title":"Multi-agent support: third-party coding agent executors","description":"Extend `xpo drive` and `xpo loop` to work with coding agents beyond Claude Code. Each agent gets a dedicated `AgentExecutor` that handles CLI invocation, output parsing, and usage/token tracking.\n\nA `GenericExecutor` already works as a fallback for any agent that accepts a prompt argument. Dedicated executors can leverage agent-specific features like structured output, usage stats, and streaming.\n\n### Sub-issues\n- Codex executor\n- Gemini CLI executor\n- OpenCode executor\n- Pi executor\n\n### Scope\nEach executor implements the `AgentExecutor` interface: spawn the agent subprocess, feed it the prompt, stream output, parse completion status, and extract token/cost metrics where the agent exposes them.","sort_order":"bO3"},"created_at":"2026-08-31T11:17:05.162639Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.251 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
