{"id":"xpo-d82dc7","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"Restructure the CLI history commands:\n\n### `xpo history \u003cissueID\u003e` (changed)\nPrint a human-readable timeline matching the web UI's activity view — status transitions, comments, merges, assignments, and artifact updates rendered as a chronological narrative with timestamps and actors. Should be scannable at a glance, not a raw event dump.\n\n### `xpo log \u003cissueID\u003e` (new)\nMove the current `xpo history` raw event output here. Prints the full event audit trail as structured data (one JSON event per line or formatted table). Useful for debugging and scripting.","labels":["feature","CLI"],"sort_order":"bPQ","status":"BACKLOG","title":"`xpo history` shows timeline, raw event log moves to `xpo log`"},"created_at":"2026-08-31T11:19:43.598236Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.251 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
