{"id":"xpo-65e8e3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-69b8923f-47ca-448e-a71e-0c2298ae0e2a","text":"**Summary**\n\nAdded a fourth \"Done\" tab to the backlog view.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Extended the `Tab` type union with `\"done\"` in `Backlog.tsx`\n- Added `done: { label: \"Done\", statuses: [\"DONE\"] }` to `TAB_CONFIGS` in both `Backlog.tsx` and `useBacklogRows.ts`\n- Fixed the default group expansion logic so the DONE status group starts expanded when on the Done tab (previously it was always collapsed by default)\n\n**What comes for free:**\n- Sort defaults to `updated` (most recently completed first) — the existing per-status override at `useBacklogRows.ts:125` already forces this for DONE groups\n- Flat/nested toggle persists independently via `exponential-backlog-hierarchy-done` in localStorage\n- Ghost parents appear in nested mode for children whose parent isn't DONE\n- Filters, DnD, expand/collapse all work unchanged\n\n**Status:** type-checks pass, ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-08-31T13:22:07.178101Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.251 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
