{"id":"xpo-a18d46","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"title":"Terminal statuses: CANCELED and DUPLICATE","description":"Add CANCELED and DUPLICATE as terminal statuses alongside DONE. This replaces the original resolution-field approach — a single dimension (status) is simpler to filter, display, and reason about.\\n\\n### Status graph\\n\\n`BACKLOG → PLANNED → DOING → DONE; DOING ⇄ BLOCKED`\\n\\nAll non-terminal statuses can transition to any terminal status (DONE, CANCELED, DUPLICATE). Terminal statuses can transition back to non-terminal (reopen).\\n\\n### Terminal vs Completed\\n\\n- **Terminal** = DONE, CANCELED, DUPLICATE — issue is closed\\n- **Completed** = DONE only — work was shipped (for velocity, burndown, epic progress)\\n\\n### Icons (Lucide)\\n\\n- DONE: `CircleCheck` (green) — existing\\n- CANCELED: `CircleMinus` (orange)\\n- DUPLICATE: `CircleSlash` (orange)\\n\\n### Completion dialog\\n\\nTriggered on any transition to a terminal status. Contains:\\n- Resolution dropdown (DONE default, CANCELED, DUPLICATE)\\n- Completion comment (optional, markdown)\\n- Complete / Cancel buttons\\n\\nIf issue has children, cascade prompt integrates with the dialog.\\n\\n### Scope\\n\\n**Go backend:**\\n- Add `StatusCanceled` and `StatusDuplicate` constants\\n- Add `IsTerminal(s)` and `IsCompleted(s)` helpers\\n- Replace ~15 hardcoded `StatusDone` checks with appropriate helper\\n- Update `ValidateStatus`, MCP tools, CLI commands\\n- `merge` always sets DONE\\n- `list` supports filtering by new statuses\\n\\n**React frontend:**\\n- Add `isTerminal()` and `isCompleted()` utils\\n- Replace ~25 hardcoded `\\\"DONE\\\"` checks\\n- Add status icons for CANCELED and DUPLICATE\\n- Update status constants, board columns, backlog groups\\n- Completion dialog on terminal transitions\""},"created_at":"2026-08-31T13:46:25.332532Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.251 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
