{"id":"xpo-a18d46","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-e3dd8040-87e8-4970-b4f8-85fb09d0b774","text":"**Summary**\n\nAdded CANCELED and DUPLICATE as terminal statuses alongside DONE. Introduced `IsTerminal()` / `IsCompleted()` helpers on both Go and TypeScript sides to replace hardcoded `\"DONE\"` checks across the entire codebase.\n\n**Backend changes:**\n- `model/types.go`: added `StatusCanceled`, `StatusDuplicate`, `IsTerminal()`, `IsCompleted()`\n- `update.go`: blocker checks use `IsTerminal()`, auto-close parent triggers on any terminal child\n- `start.go`: rejects all terminal statuses (not just DONE)\n- `projection.go`: cycle rollover skips all terminal\n- `drive.go`: blocker check uses `IsTerminal()`\n- `server/metrics.go`: staleness/bug-age exclude all terminal, velocity/epic progress count only `IsCompleted()`\n- `server/handlers.go`: cycle done counts use `IsCompleted()`, burndown uses `IsCompleted()`\n- `list.go`, `maintenance.go`, `branches.go`: all use `IsTerminal()`\n- `ui/styles.go`: orange color and icons for CANCELED (⊖) and DUPLICATE (⊘)\n- `inputs.go`, `client.go`, `mcpserver/tools.go`: all status validation updated\n- `merge` still always sets DONE\n\n**Frontend changes:**\n- `constants.ts`: added `isTerminal()`, `isCompleted()` helpers and CANCELED/DUPLICATE to STATUS_OPTIONS\n- `StatusIcon.tsx`: CircleMinus (orange) for CANCELED, CircleSlash (orange) for DUPLICATE\n- `index.css`: `--color-status-canceled` and `--color-status-duplicate` CSS variables\n- `sort.ts`: STATUS_ORDER includes new statuses\n- `Backlog.tsx`, `useBacklogRows.ts`: all `\"DONE\"` checks replaced, TAB_CONFIGS updated, STATUS_LABELS extended\n- `Board.tsx`, `BoardColumn.tsx`: new columns, terminal sort override\n- `PropertySidebar.tsx`: cascade prompt and merge button use `isTerminal()`\n- `NewIssueModal.tsx`: parent picker excludes all terminal\n- `Dashboard.tsx`: \"done\" counts use `isCompleted()`, \"active\" filters exclude all terminal\n\n**Tests added:**\n- `model/types_test.go`: `TestIsTerminal`, `TestIsCompleted` — exhaustive status coverage\n- `start_test.go`: `TestStartWork_CanceledIssue`, `TestStartWork_DuplicateIssue` — reject terminal\n- `update_test.go`: 6 new tests\n  - `TestUpdateIssue_BlockerCanceled_Unblocks` — CANCELED blocker unblocks\n  - `TestUpdateIssue_BlockerDuplicate_Unblocks` — DUPLICATE blocker unblocks\n  - `TestUpdateIssue_LastCompletedWithCanceledChild` — auto-close fires on CANCELED child\n  - `TestUpdateIssue_LastCompletedMixedTerminal` — auto-close with DONE+CANCELED+DUPLICATE children\n  - `TestUpdateIssue_LastCompletedNotTriggeredByActiveChild` — no auto-close with active child\n  - `TestUpdateIssue_TerminalToActive` — reopening CANCELED → PLANNED works\n- `inputs_test.go`: `TestValidateStatus` updated to include CANCELED and DUPLICATE\n\n**Status:** all Go tests pass, frontend type-checks clean, ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-08-31T13:58:40.01124Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.251 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
