{"id":"xpo-a49ec2","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-43511c13-3041-4941-a660-9c9ca7f3b704","text":"## Summary\n\nReplaced the flat dependency table with an interactive directed-graph visualization.\n\n**New files:**\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/useDepGraph.ts` — hook that builds the graph model: collects edges from `issue.dependencies`, deduplicates inverse pairs, detects cycles via DFS, computes critical path (longest unresolved blocker chain), and runs dagre layout to get `(x, y)` positions\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/DepGraph.tsx` — SVG graph renderer with `foreignObject` nodes wrapping React components (`StatusIcon`, truncated title, issue ID), directed edge paths with arrowhead markers, pan (mouse drag) and zoom (scroll wheel)\n\n**Modified files:**\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/Dependencies.tsx` — two-mode view (graph default, list fallback), header with blocker summary (\"N of M blockers resolved\"), epic/status filter dropdowns, completed toggle, fit-to-screen button, view mode toggle\n- `web/package.json` — added `@dagrejs/dagre` (~5kb gzip) and `@types/dagre`\n\n## Rationale\n\ndagre for layout (deterministic Sugiyama layered algorithm, tiny footprint) + custom SVG rendering for full control over styling with existing design system CSS variables and React components. No heavy graph library needed.\n\n## Decisions made\n\n- **Suffix fallback for `target_id`**: both `useDepGraph` and `ListView` use `issues.find(i =\u003e i.id.endsWith(targetId))` as fallback, matching the pattern from xpo-147414\n- **Cycle handling**: cycles detected pre-dagre, cycle edges excluded from dagre input (which requires a DAG), rendered with dashed stroke + warning color + triangle icon on involved nodes\n- **Critical path**: computed as longest chain of unresolved `blocks`/`depends_on` edges, highlighted with thicker accent-colored stroke\n- **foreignObject for nodes**: reuses `StatusIcon` and Tailwind classes directly inside SVG nodes\n\n## Status\n\n- TypeScript: zero errors\n- Build: passes (`make frontend`, `make build`)\n- Tests: all pass (`make test`)\n- Browser tested: graph renders, list toggle works, node click navigates to issue detail, pan/zoom functional, filters work\n\nReady for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-07T09:29:02.733482Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-a49ec2","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"action":"updated","artifact_type":"spec","filename":"spec.md"},"created_at":"2026-09-07T09:35:00.963883Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-a49ec2","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-2ea329a5-ba2e-4d55-a5be-da0f8263d2e9","text":"## Reworked UX — Table + Graph Drill-down\n\nBased on feedback, completely reworked the UX flow:\n\n**Default: filterable dependency table**\n- Each row: `StatusIcon ID PrimaryLabel Title` → `kind badge` → `StatusIcon ID PrimaryLabel Title`\n- Filterable by dependency kind (Blocks, Depends on, Relates to, Child, Parent, Duplicates)\n- Searchable by issue ID or title\n- \"Show completed\" toggle filters out all-DONE rows\n- Blocker summary in header: \"N of M blockers resolved\"\n- Clicking a row opens the graph drill-down for that issue's connected subgraph\n\n**Graph drill-down** (`#/dependencies/\u003cissueId\u003e`)\n- Shows the connected component containing the focus issue (BFS traversal)\n- Back button + Escape returns to the table\n- Header shows \"Dependencies for [issue title]\"\n- Same graph renderer: dagre layout, status-colored nodes, directed edges, cycle warnings, critical path highlighting\n- Focus issue node has accent border to stand out\n- Pan/zoom + fit-to-screen button\n\n**Entry from issue detail**\n- Dependency links in `PropertySidebar.tsx` now show a graph icon on hover\n- Clicking it navigates to `#/dependencies/\u003cissueId\u003e`, landing directly in the graph drill-down\n\n**Routing** (`App.tsx`)\n- `parseHash`/`setHash` extended to handle `#/dependencies/\u003cissueId\u003e` route\n- `depFocusId` state threaded through to Dependencies component\n\n### Files changed\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/Dependencies.tsx` — rewritten: table default + graph drill-down\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/DepGraph.tsx` — updated: receives focusIssue, has back button header\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/useDepGraph.ts` — updated: `focusIssueId` param, connected component BFS, extracted `computeStats`\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/PropertySidebar.tsx` — added graph icon link on dependency rows\n- `web/src/App.tsx` — extended routing for `#/dependencies/\u003cid\u003e`\n- `web/package.json` — `@dagrejs/dagre` + `@types/dagre`\n\n### Status\n- TypeScript: zero errors\n- Build: passes\n- Tests: all pass\n\nReady for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-07T09:39:31.164281Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
