{"id":"xpo-c08d52","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"56 lint errors across 21 files. All pre-existing on main. The pre-commit hook runs `bun run lint` (eslint on the full project) so these block any frontend commit.\n\n### Error breakdown\n\n| Count | Rule | Fix approach |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| 14 | `react-hooks/exhaustive-deps` | Add missing deps, move constants outside components |\n| 9 | `Cannot access refs during render` | Move ref reads into effects/handlers |\n| 7 | `no-empty` | Add actual error handling or explicit ignore comments with reason |\n| 6 | `react-refresh/only-export-components` | Split exports into separate files |\n| 6 | `@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars` | Remove dead code |\n| 5 | `setState synchronously within effect` | Restructure to avoid sync setState |\n| 5 | `Compilation Skipped: memoization` | Fix useCallback/useMemo dep arrays |\n| 3 | `@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any` | Replace with proper types |\n| 1 | `Cannot reassign variable after render` | Use useMemo or restructure |\n\n### Affected files\n\n- `components/Backlog/Backlog.tsx`\n- `components/Backlog/DndComponents.tsx`\n- `components/Backlog/FilterMenu.tsx`\n- `components/Backlog/useBacklogRows.ts`\n- `components/Board/Board.tsx`\n- `components/Cycles/Cycles.tsx`\n- `components/Dashboard/Dashboard.tsx`\n- `components/Dashboard/charts.tsx`\n- `components/Dashboard/Section.tsx`\n- `components/Inbox/Inbox.tsx`\n- `components/IssueDetail/IssueDetail.tsx`\n- `components/IssueDetail/MergeView.tsx`\n- `components/MarkdownEditor.tsx`\n- `components/MyIssues/MyIssues.tsx`\n- `components/ui/Badge.tsx`\n- `components/ui/ContextMenu.tsx`\n- `components/ui/OverflowLabels.tsx`\n- `components/ui/Popover.tsx`\n- `components/ui/Toast.tsx`\n- `hooks/useSSE.ts`\n- `utils/sort.ts`\n\n### Rules\n\n- **No eslint-disable comments.** Fix the actual code.\n- `no-empty` catch blocks: add real handling or an explicit `{ /* ignored */ }` comment explaining why\n- Test with `cd web \u0026\u0026 bun run lint` — must exit 0","estimate":3,"labels":["bug","frontend"],"priority":2,"sort_order":"a5","status":"PLANNED","title":"Fix all frontend eslint errors — no suppression comments"},"created_at":"2026-09-07T10:14:42.140423Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-c08d52","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@macbook.local\u003e","description":"56 lint errors across 21 files. All pre-existing on main. The pre-commit hook runs `bun run lint` (eslint on the full project) so these block any frontend commit.\n\n### Rules\n\n- **No eslint-disable comments.** Fix the actual code.\n- `no-empty` catch blocks: add real handling or an explicit `{ /* ignored */ }` comment explaining why\n- Test with `cd web \u0026\u0026 bun run lint` — must exit 0","sort_order":"Zx","status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-09-07T14:20:56.997707Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
