{"id":"xpo-c08d52","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-b674b451-b952-4d49-8ba8-0b7c330b87b8","text":"## Summary\n\nFixed all 63 eslint errors (47 errors, 16 warnings) across 21 files with zero `eslint-disable` comments. `bun run lint` exits 0.\n\n**Files changed:** 24 (21 modified, 3 new extraction files)\n\n### Categories of fixes\n\n- **`no-empty`** (11): Added explicit comments to intentionally empty catch blocks (`localStorage`, `JSON.parse`, best-effort fetches)\n- **`react-hooks/exhaustive-deps`** (12): Added missing deps, removed unnecessary ones, moved static constants to module scope (`GO_TARGETS`, `STATUS_ORDER_MAP`, `ALL_STATUSES`)\n- **`react-hooks/preserve-manual-memoization`** (4): Added missing deps so React Compiler can preserve manual `useCallback`/`useMemo`\n- **React Compiler refs/setState** (10): Moved ref writes from render to `useEffect`; replaced `setState` positioning patterns with direct DOM manipulation (`Popover`, `ContextMenu`, `FilterMenu`)\n- **`react-refresh/only-export-components`** (4): Extracted non-component exports to separate files (`BadgeContexts.ts`, `ToastContext.ts`, `backlogCollision.ts`, `sectionIcons.ts`)\n- **`@typescript-eslint/no-unused-vars`** (6): Removed unused params, variables, imports\n- **`@typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any`** (3): Typed tiptap-markdown storage with `MarkdownStorage` interface\n- **`react-hooks/immutability`** (1): Replaced mutable `let` accumulators with `reduce`\n- **`react-hooks/set-state-in-effect`** (1): Replaced auto-select effect with derived state (`Inbox`)\n\n### Additional changes\n\n- `Makefile`: `make lint` now runs `go vet` + `cd web \u0026\u0026 bun run lint`; `make test` depends on `lint`\n- `CLAUDE.md`: Documents lint target and pre-completion gate\n\n### Decisions made\n\n- **Direct DOM for positioning:** Popover, ContextMenu, and FilterMenu positioning converted from `useState` + `useLayoutEffect` to direct `el.style` writes. Avoids cascading renders while keeping the same visual behavior (layout effects run before paint).\n- **Inbox derived state:** Replaced the auto-select `useEffect` with `effectiveSelectedId`/`effectiveFocusedIndex` derived values. Eliminates the flash of no-selection on first render.\n- **Dead code removal:** Removed `statusCards`/`stats` from Dashboard (annotated \"for future use\" but unused and blocking lint).\n\n## Status\n\nAll tests passing. `make lint` exits 0. Ready for review.\n\n8 UX issues discovered during tophatting filed under **UI Polish** epic (`xpo-f539b6`)."},"created_at":"2026-09-07T15:37:30.830903Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
