{"id":"xpo-e5d2e4","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-09-07T15:55:50.656574Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"web"}
{"id":"xpo-08fb57","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"## Feature\n\nOn the **Backlog** view, add keyboard shortcuts to expand and collapse all grouped sections at once.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n- `e` expands all collapsed groups\n- `c` collapses all expanded groups\n- Scroll position should be preserved after toggling\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nNo keyboard shortcut exists for bulk expand/collapse — users must click each group individually.","labels":["feature","frontend"],"parent_id":"xpo-f539b6","sort_order":"bUP","status":"BACKLOG","title":"Backlog view: `e`/`c` shortcuts for expand/collapse all"},"created_at":"2026-09-07T15:56:14.581126Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
