{"id":"xpo-911a91","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3adf0991-ee53-46b3-8976-7593221dc2ac","text":"**Summary:** Added viewport-aware positioning for ContextMenu sub-menus in `ContextMenu.tsx`:\n- Added `subMenuRef` and a `useLayoutEffect` that measures the sub-menu after render\n- **Horizontal:** if the sub-menu's right edge exceeds the viewport, flips it to the left of the main menu via `order: -1` and swapping margin direction\n- **Vertical:** if the sub-menu extends below the viewport, reduces the `marginTop` to keep it within bounds\n\n**Rationale:** Uses direct style manipulation on the ref to avoid re-render loops. The flex `order` property cleanly swaps left/right placement without changing the DOM structure.\n\n**Status:** Lint and tests pass, ready for tophat."},"created_at":"2026-09-07T16:27:06.272102Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
