{"id":"xpo-2dd9a8","type":"CREATE","payload":{"dependencies":[{"kind":"relates_to","source_id":"xpo-2dd9a8","target_id":"xpo-93e234"}],"description":"## Problem\n\nWhen ghost children are filtered out (e.g., in the backlog view where only BACKLOG/PLANNED items show), a parent issue that has *only* ghost children appears with an expand chevron — but expanding it reveals nothing. This is misleading: the chevron promises expandable content that doesn't exist.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nParents with no visible children after filtering should **not** display the expand/collapse chevron. To keep the layout consistent (prevent horizontal shifting), replace the chevron with a non-interactive placeholder icon or spacer of the same dimensions.\n\n## Related\n\n- `xpo-93e234` fixed ghost children *duplication* across status groups but did not address the empty-parent chevron case.","estimate":1,"labels":["feature","frontend"],"parent_id":"xpo-f539b6","sort_order":"bUf","status":"PLANNED","title":"Hide expand chevron on parents with no visible children"},"created_at":"2026-09-08T11:29:58.502032Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-2dd9a8","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"description":"## Problem\n\nWhen ghost children are filtered out (e.g., in the backlog view where only BACKLOG/PLANNED items show), a parent issue that has *only* ghost children appears with an expand chevron — but expanding it reveals nothing. This is misleading: the chevron promises expandable content that doesn't exist.\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nParents with no visible children after filtering should **not** display the expand/collapse chevron. To keep the layout consistent (prevent horizontal shifting), replace the chevron with a non-interactive placeholder icon or spacer of the same dimensions.\n\n## Related\n\n- xpo-93e234 fixed ghost children *duplication* across status groups but did not address the empty-parent chevron case."},"created_at":"2026-09-08T11:30:50.873916Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
