{"id":"xpo-1fccf2","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Fix xpo merge auto-checkout when hub is on the feature branch","description":"## Bug\n\nxpo-d5c047 added auto-checkout of the default branch in `xpo merge` for branch mode. The detection uses `FindWorktreeForBranch` to check if a worktree exists — if not, it falls back to checkout-based merge.\n\nHowever, `FindWorktreeForBranch` includes the **main checkout itself** in the worktree list. When the hub is checked out to the feature branch (branch mode), it matches and `useWorktrees` stays `true`, hitting the \"park the hub on the default branch\" error.\n\n## Fix\n\nCompare the worktree path returned by `FindWorktreeForBranch` against `storage.HubRoot()`. If they match, the \"worktree\" is just the main checkout on the feature branch — treat as branch mode.\n\n## Related\n\n- xpo-d5c047 introduced the auto-checkout logic","status":"DOING","estimate":1,"sort_order":"bUg","assignee":"Claude Code \u003cagent@macbook.local\u003e","dependencies":[{"source_id":"xpo-1fccf2","target_id":"xpo-d5c047","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["bug","CLI"]},"created_at":"2026-09-08T11:54:05.559241Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
