{"id":"xpo-7a5bba","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Add comprehensive merge test coverage","description":"## Problem\n\n`MergeIssue` has significant untested code paths. Only squash strategy with `KeepBranch: true` on a clean branch-mode scenario is covered. Multiple strategies, error paths, and worktree flows have zero test coverage.\n\n## Missing Tests\n\n### Merge strategies\n1. `MergeStrategyMerge` (--no-ff) — different amend commit path\n2. `MergeStrategyFF` (--ff-only) — plus failure when branches diverge\n3. Custom commit message via `opts.CommitMessage`\n\n### Error paths\n4. No branch found (`BranchStats == nil`)\n5. Zero commits ahead of base\n6. Merge conflict + abort path\n7. Checkout failure in branch mode\n\n### Branch deletion\n8. `DeleteBranch` option — all existing tests use `KeepBranch: true`\n\n### Worktree mode\n9. Worktree cleanup after successful merge\n10. Hub on wrong branch in true worktree mode\n\n### issues.db preservation\n11. FF strategy + diverged issues.db — union path only tested for squash","status":"PLANNED","estimate":3,"sort_order":"bUf","dependencies":[{"source_id":"xpo-7a5bba","target_id":"xpo-1fccf2","kind":"relates_to"}],"labels":["improvement","CLI"]},"created_at":"2026-09-08T11:58:31.090469Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
