{"id":"xpo-b83765","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-df7e21c8-a5fe-4ee0-bbbf-e9e19366b363","text":"## Summary\n\nNew file `internal/exponential/git_test.go` with 14 tests covering every exported function in `git.go`.\n\n**Tests:**\n- `DefaultBranch` — fallback to \"main\" without remote, detection via `symbolic-ref` with remote\n- `BranchExists` — true/false cases\n- `CreateAndCheckoutBranch` — success + already-exists error\n- `CheckoutBranch` — success + nonexistent error\n- `WorktreeLifecycle` — add → list → remove → verify gone\n- `WorktreeList_IncludesHub` — hub checkout always appears in list\n- `FindWorktreeForBranch` — linked worktree found, not found, hub checkout match\n\n**Notes:**\n- `initTestRepo` helper resolves symlinks (macOS `/var` → `/private/var`) so paths match git output\n- `DefaultBranch_WithRemote` requires `git remote set-head` after push to set `origin/HEAD`\n\n## Status\n\n`make test` passes. Test-only, no production code changes. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-08T12:21:19.496307Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
