{"id":"xpo-3da9ff","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-5ef82470-0f7a-4080-aaac-bdd0e1cb20da","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded BACKLOG guard to `StartWork` in `start.go`. BACKLOG issues now return: \"issue %s is in BACKLOG — move it to PLANNED before starting\".\n\n**Test:** `TestStartWork_BacklogIssue_Rejected` verifies the error mentions both BACKLOG and PLANNED.\n\n## Status\n\n`make test` passes. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-08T12:55:02.186382Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
