{"id":"xpo-eb76cd","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-8f3858d5-06ab-4b07-9a15-c31c46e4297b","text":"## Implementation complete\n\n### Summary\n\nReplaced the three-button tab strip (All / Issues / Commits) in `Timeline.tsx` with a multi-select event-type filter popover.\n\n**New filter categories (6):**\n- **Issues** — CREATE and non-terminal UPDATE events\n- **Closed** — UPDATE with status DONE / CANCELED / DUPLICATE\n- **Comments** — COMMENT events\n- **Merges** — MERGE events\n- **Artifacts** — ARTIFACT events (specs, walkthroughs, uploaded artifacts)\n- **Commits** — git commits\n\n**UI changes:**\n- Tab strip removed from `TopBar.left`\n- Funnel icon filter button added to `TopBar.right` (matching Backlog/MyIssues pattern)\n- Accent dot indicator when not all types are selected\n- Checklist popover with All / None shortcuts, one checkbox row per category\n- Person filter stays alongside in `TopBar.right`\n\n**Also fixed missing event rendering:**\n- ARTIFACT events now render in the timeline (previously fell through and were hidden)\n- CANCELED / DUPLICATE status transitions now have correct icons (`Ban` / `Copy`) and verbs\n\n### Rationale\n- Filtering moved from server-side (`kind` query param) to client-side — toggling filters is now instant with no re-fetch\n- Single-panel checklist (vs Backlog's two-panel dimension menu) since there's only one filter dimension here\n\n### Decisions made\n- Used `Paperclip` icon for artifacts (matching `ActivityFeed.tsx` pattern)\n- Used `Ban` for CANCELED and `Copy` for DUPLICATE (matching their semantic meaning)\n- Popover anchors right-aligned to the button (since it's on the right side of the top bar)\n\n### Status\n- TypeScript compiles clean\n- `make test` passes (lint + tests)\n- Ready for review"},"created_at":"2026-09-08T14:19:47.77568Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
