{"id":"xpo-958474","type":"CREATE","payload":{"description":"## Bug\n\nChecklist checkboxes in rendered markdown (specs, walkthroughs, descriptions) are barely visible against the dark background and are not aligned flush-left with the content margin.\n\n### Current behavior\n- Checkbox squares are faint/low-contrast — nearly invisible\n- Checkboxes are indented from the left margin instead of aligned with surrounding text\n\n### Expected\n- Checkboxes should have clear contrast (visible border or fill)\n- Checklist items should align left with the rest of the content, no extra indentation\n\n### Where it appears\nAnywhere markdown with `- [ ]` checklists is rendered — spec tab, walkthrough tab, issue descriptions.","estimate":1,"labels":["bug","frontend"],"parent_id":"xpo-f539b6","sort_order":"bUg","status":"PLANNED","title":"Markdown checklists: boxes barely visible and not left-aligned"},"created_at":"2026-09-08T14:39:32.68975Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
