{"id":"xpo-46c418","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-cdc0eeb0-c015-4a07-a833-84639e2403d0","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded vitest as the frontend test framework with 72 tests across 2 test files.\n\n**Setup:**\n- Installed `vitest` as a dev dependency in `web/`\n- Added `\"test\": \"vitest run\"` script to `web/package.json`\n- Added `frontend-test` Makefile target; wired into `make test` so it runs alongside Go tests\n\n**Extracted utilities:**\n- Created `web/src/components/IssueDetail/diff-utils.ts` — extracted `parseDiffByFile`, `addLineNumbers`, `buildFileTree`, `flattenSingleChildDirs`, `buildSplitLines` and their types (`FileTreeNode`, `NumberedLine`, `SplitLine`) from `MergeView.tsx` to satisfy `react-refresh/only-export-components` lint rule (can't export non-component functions from a component file)\n\n**Tests:**\n- `web/src/components/IssueDetail/MergeView.test.ts` — 27 tests covering all 5 diff utility functions\n- `web/src/utils/format.test.ts` — 45 tests covering all 8 format utility functions\n\n## Rationale\n\nExtracting utilities into `diff-utils.ts` was necessary to satisfy the `react-refresh/only-export-components` eslint rule without suppressing it. This is a clean separation — the utility functions are pure and have no React dependencies.\n\n## Status\n\n`make test` passes (lint + 72 vitest tests + Go tests), `tsc` clean. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-08T15:03:17.660846Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
