{"id":"xpo-653324","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Expand vitest coverage to remaining utilities and components","description":"## Feature\n\nExtend vitest coverage beyond `diff-utils.ts` and `format.ts` to the remaining pure utility modules and testable logic.\n\n### Candidates\n\n**Pure utility modules (high value, easy to test):**\n- `utils/labels.ts` — `canonicalLabel`, `labelColor`, `toggleLabel`, `deduplicateLabels`, `mergeAndSort`, `splitLabels`, `contrastTextColor`\n- `utils/sort.ts` — `computeAppendKey`, `sortIssuesWithinGroups`, `sortGroup`\n- `utils/keyboard.ts` — `isEditableTarget`\n- `constants.ts` — `isTerminal`, `isCompleted`\n\n**Domain logic (moderate complexity):**\n- `components/Dependencies/useDepGraph.ts` — `resolveIssue`, `collectEdges`, `isResolved`, `computeStats` (pure functions extractable from the hook)\n- `components/Backlog/filters.ts` — `hasActiveFilters`\n- `components/Backlog/backlogCollision.ts` — custom DnD collision detection\n\n### Out of scope\n\nComponent rendering tests (`@testing-library/react`) — that's a separate effort requiring jsdom/happy-dom setup.","status":"PLANNED","parent_id":"xpo-f539b6","estimate":5,"sort_order":"bUg","dependencies":[{"source_id":"xpo-653324","target_id":"xpo-46c418","kind":"depends_on"}],"labels":["feature","frontend","testing"]},"created_at":"2026-09-08T15:06:19.631058Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
