{"id":"xpo-653324","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-03b429a8-c7f3-431b-a8f1-4155c01e9d8c","text":"## Summary\n\nAdded 65 new tests across 5 test files, bringing the vitest total from 72 to 137.\n\n**New test files:**\n- `web/src/utils/labels.test.ts` — 20 tests covering all 7 exported functions (`canonicalLabel`, `labelColor`, `toggleLabel`, `deduplicateLabels`, `mergeAndSort`, `splitLabels`, `contrastTextColor`)\n- `web/src/utils/sort.test.ts` — 14 tests covering `computeAppendKey`, `sortIssuesWithinGroups`, `sortGroup`\n- `web/src/constants.test.ts` — 9 tests covering `isTerminal`, `isCompleted`\n- `web/src/components/Backlog/filters.test.ts` — 7 tests covering `hasActiveFilters`\n- `web/src/components/Dependencies/useDepGraph.test.ts` — 15 tests covering `resolveIssue`, `collectEdges`, `isResolved`, `computeStats`\n\n**Supporting:**\n- `web/src/test-utils.ts` — shared `makeIssue()` factory for building `Issue` stubs with sensible defaults\n\n## Rationale\n\nFocused on pure functions with the highest regression risk: case-insensitive label operations, WCAG luminance, multi-key sorting with status grouping, and dependency graph edge canonicalization/resolution. Skipped `keyboard.ts` and `backlogCollision.ts` as both require DOM/library mocking (out of scope per issue description).\n\n## Status\n\n`make test` passes (lint + 137 vitest + Go tests). Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-08T16:03:19.886796Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"xpo-653324","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-fe4d5358-1a0e-4956-88eb-797b9817e6ea","text":"## Updated Summary\n\nTotal: **244 tests** across **12 test files** (up from 72 tests in 2 files).\n\n### New test files (172 new tests)\n- `utils/labels.test.ts` — 20 tests (7 functions)\n- `utils/sort.test.ts` — 14 tests (3 functions)\n- `utils/issues.test.ts` — 10 tests (`buildChildrenByParent`, `collectKnownPeople`)\n- `utils/md5.test.ts` — 6 tests (RFC 1321 test vectors)\n- `utils/format.test.ts` — +10 new tests (`extractEmail`, `fuzzyMatch`)\n- `constants.test.ts` — 9 tests (`isTerminal`, `isCompleted`)\n- `components/Backlog/filters.test.ts` — 34 tests (`hasActiveFilters`, `matchesFilters`, `chipLabel`, `getSelected`, `setSelected`)\n- `components/Dependencies/useDepGraph.test.ts` — 15 tests (4 pure functions)\n- `components/Dependencies/dep-graph-utils.test.ts` — 11 tests (`truncate`, `kindColor`, `edgePath`)\n- `components/Timeline/timeline-utils.test.ts` — 22 tests (6 functions)\n- `components/Inbox/inbox-utils.test.ts` — 18 tests (`groupByIssue`, `agentLabel`, `buildChangeSummary`)\n\n### Refactoring (extract + deduplicate)\n- **`extractEmail`** — extracted from Inbox + MyIssues → `utils/format.ts`\n- **`fuzzyMatch`** — extracted from CommandPalette → `utils/format.ts`\n- **`buildChildrenByParent`** — extracted from Backlog + Board → `utils/issues.ts`\n- **`collectKnownPeople`** — extracted from PropertySidebar + ContextMenu + NewIssueModal (3 copies) → `utils/issues.ts`\n- **`matchesFilters`** — extracted from Backlog + MyIssues + Inbox (3 copies) → `filters.ts`\n- **`chipLabel`, `getSelected`, `setSelected`** — extracted from FilterChips + FilterMenu → `filters.ts`\n- **`md5`** — extracted from Avatar → `utils/md5.ts`\n- **Timeline helpers** (`categorizeEntry`, `groupByDay`, `dayLabel`, `daySummary`, `entryActor`, `extractContributors`) — extracted from Timeline.tsx → `timeline-utils.ts`\n- **DepGraph helpers** (`truncate`, `edgePath`, `kindColor`) — extracted from DepGraph + Dependencies → `dep-graph-utils.ts`\n- **Inbox helpers** (`groupByIssue`, `agentLabel`, `buildChangeSummary`, `IssueGroup`) — extracted from Inbox → `inbox-utils.ts`\n\n## Status\n\n`make test` passes (lint + 244 vitest + Go tests). Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-08T16:33:06.718989Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.263 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
