{"id":"xpo-76e2a1","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-f30ca027-1b1a-4a71-8804-661447d86bb6","text":"## Implementation Complete\n\n### Summary\n\nRedesigned the `xpo init` flow into a unified wizard and overhauled `xpo doctor` with reorganized sections and a `--fix` flag. Introduced managed blocks for safe integration refreshes and changed prefix storage to bare format.\n\n**New files:**\n- `internal/exponential/managed_block.go` — `ManagedBlock` type, `FindManagedBlock()`, `WrapManagedBlock()`, `ReplaceManagedBlock()`, `ComputeBlockHash()`, `BlockWasEdited()`\n- `internal/exponential/plan.go` — `ChangePlan`, `ComputeInitPlan()` for terraform-style file change previews\n- `internal/exponential/managed_block_test.go` — 14 tests for managed block parsing, hashing, wrapping, replacement\n- `internal/version/version_test.go` — version comparison tests\n\n**Rewritten files:**\n- `cmd/exponential/init.go` — unified wizard: git check → prefix prompt → agent multi-select → change plan → confirm → apply (MCP + instructions + skills). Re-init flow handles up-to-date/stale/downgrade/edited-by-hand cases. Flags: `--yes`, `--prefix`, `--agents`, `--force`\n- `cmd/exponential/doctor.go` — sections reorganized to xpo / Project / Integrations / This machine. Added `--fix` (consent-follows-blast-radius) and `--strict` flags. `InfoPrefix` (`·`) for informational items.\n- `cmd/exponential/main.go` — branded welcome when `xpo` is run outside a project\n\n**Deleted files:**\n- `cmd/exponential/init_mcp.go` — absorbed into unified init\n- `cmd/exponential/init_skill.go` — absorbed into unified init\n\n**Modified across codebase:**\n- `agents.go` — `AppendAgentInstructions()` now writes managed blocks (`\u003c!-- xpo:begin VERSION sha256:HASH --\u003e`) with legacy heading migration. New `WriteAgentInstructions()` returns `InstructionWriteResult` with edit detection.\n- `config.go` — added `IntegrationVersion` field, prefix normalized on load (strips trailing `-`)\n- `setup.go` — `DefaultPrefix()` returns bare prefix, `InitProject()` stamps `integration_version` in config\n- `add.go`, `local_transport.go`, `server/handlers.go` — prefix separator added at point of use\n- `ui/styles.go` — added `InfoPrefix` (`·`)\n- `ui/list.go` — ID width accounts for separator\n- `version.go` — added `CompareVersions()` for semver comparison\n- `demo.go` — prefix without trailing dash\n\n**Interactive prompts** use `charmbracelet/huh` (same ecosystem as lipgloss): input, multi-select, confirm, select.\n\n### Rationale\n\nSingle unified command reduces cognitive load for first-time users. Terraform-style change plan builds trust before writing files. Managed blocks with content hashing enable safe refresh without touching user content.\n\n### Decisions made\n\n- Used `charmbracelet/huh` for all interactive prompts per spec\n- `isInteractive()` moved to `utils.go` to be shared between init and doctor\n- `resolveAgents()` stayed in `init.go` rather than moving to the internal package since it's CLI-specific\n- Generic Agent is auto-included when any selected agent writes to AGENTS.md\n\n### Status\n\n`make test` passes (go vet + eslint + 263 frontend tests + Go tests). Ready for review.\n"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T07:25:25.638209Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.267 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
