{"id":"xpo-d47781","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-7bca03a8-7e86-4cb4-87fa-9942898f0dd5","text":"## Implementation complete\n\n- Added a generic, controlled `Tabs\u003cT\u003e` selector component in the shared UI layer; it renders no tab panels, so each view retains ownership of state and content below `TopBar`.\n- Migrated Backlog and My Issues from duplicated underlined-button markup to `Tabs`.\n- Centralized `[` / `]` cycling with wrapping, editable-target/modifier guards, and suppression while view overlays are open.\n- Removed Backlog's inline tab-cycling handler and documented the shortcuts for My Issues in keyboard help.\n- Added focused tests for selector rendering, active state, cycling, wrapping, and invalid/no-op cases.\n\nAdditional implementation decision: context menus suppress tab cycling alongside filter, view, and row popovers because they are also active view overlays.\n\nVerification: `make test`, `bun run build`, `bun run lint`, and `git diff --check` all pass. Ready for review."},"created_at":"2026-09-10T12:40:49.785162Z","created_by":"codex-mcp-client/0.154.0 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
