{"id":"xpo-d47781","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-57859138-5daf-4757-8e5a-f02044d9f678","text":"Blocked pending `xpo-caf557`. Review identified that `Tabs` must not install its own document-level keyboard listener. The dependency will provide a single-listener keyboard provider and registration API; this issue's spec now requires `Tabs` to register `[`/`]` through that infrastructure."},"created_at":"2026-09-10T13:04:05.210345Z","created_by":"codex-mcp-client/0.154.0 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
